<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">YHN - Zul</book>
  <para style="h">John</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zo shirəm kan Yohana rəsh gwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohana</para>
  <para style="iot">Gabate tǝlankuri</para>
  <para style="ip">Muntu rǝsh tǝlankuri yari sun gǝs gip tǝlankuri da'a. Ama tabbate'e Yohana nye mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yesu &lt;&lt;muntu Yesu ba ndu gwa&gt;&gt; ni rǝsh tǝlankuri (Zhit gip 13.23; 19.26; 20.2; 21.7,20). Ba shino rǝsh ni sheti ghon 85 den kaar kǝ gǝri kǝ Yesu. Rǝsh ni tǝlankur kǝn kǝ dǝ gode kandatu Yesu kalma kǝ Yam kan ra na pare ko patǝn da'a dǝm mbarǝm kan dǝ dǝm gip dlom gǝmi gwa. Ti ni'e mǝn ɗǝli mbarǝm kan Yam yari'e tii cwat gwa, ti ni es'e Almasihu Nya Yami. Kano tǝp kǝba ngǝshtǝn den ti ni mbarǝm baa zam rai (20.31). Tǝlankuri pa yari ra den ba zam ni rai kan baa pa da gwa tǝp kǝba ngǝshtǝn den Almasihu. Munju kan nǝm'e Yesu ni'e tǝpe, ti ni'e ge shirǝmi, ti ni es'e rai, baa zam bi bar kǝ Yam tu kǝkǝni. Bar ho bar gip tǝlankur kǝno ar ni'e kandatu mǝn rǝshiyi pi ampani na bar ju kan ba pi se na gǝni gwa na ngashi na bar ju kan kǝ ruhu ni gwa. Bar juwo ar ni'e ga male, na bǝredi, na cirtǝni, na mǝn le tǝm na tǝm gǝsi, na shirǝm kǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Ami ni,&gt;&gt; kan es na kin inabi na mir gǝri kini.</para>
  <para style="iot">Bar ju kan ra gip tǝlankuri gwa</para>
  <para style="io">Gabate tǝlankuri 1.1-18</para>
  <para style="io">Pare pi mbap kǝ Yesu 1.19-51</para>
  <para style="io">Pi mbap kǝ Yesu na kulci mbarǝm gip pili 2.1-12.50</para>
  <para style="io">Dǝmi kǝ Yesu den bi mǝshtǝni 13.1-17.26</para>
  <para style="io">Mǝshtǝn kǝ Yesu 18.1-19.42</para>
  <para style="io">Tlitǝn kǝ Yesu gip mǝshi mbarǝme 20.1-21.25</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Kalmayi dǝmka mbarǝme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Na la'i gǝs kǝ pi ko unu na unuwo Kalma ra, Kalmayi ra na Yami, kan Kalmayiwo Yam ni. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Ti nǝra na Yam terka kapǝn dǝ pi bar kup.<verse eid="JHN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Tǝp kar ti ni pi bar kup, argon ra kan Yam pi gip bar ju tǝ pi bat nan ti gwa da'a. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Ti ni'e mǝn bi ge mbatli, ge mbatl tu ngapo ar ni'e cirtǝn kǝ mbarǝmi. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Cirtǝni ba cir ni gip dǝmǝni, ama dǝmǝni mani tle gam kǝ cirtǝni da'a.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Mbarǝm gon ra kan Yam kar ti ɗir gwa, mǝn sun'e Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Tǝ ɗir ni kǝ dǝ tǝ yari mbarǝm ge shirǝm den cirtǝni, kǝ dǝ mbarǝm kup ngǝsh wur den cirtǝn tu.<verse eid="JHN 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Yohana na gam gǝs ni'e cirtǝn tu da'a, tǝ ɗir ni kǝ dǝ tǝ yari mbarǝm ge shirǝm den cirtǝni.<verse eid="JHN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Ho cirtǝn tu kan ba bi cirtǝn ko gonge mbarǝm ra den ɗirtǝn gip atl kundǝrǝndlip.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Tǝ ra far den kaar atli, kup na tǝp kar ti ni pi atl kundǝrǝndlip, ama mbarǝm den kaar atl mani momi gǝs da'a. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Tǝ ɗir ni kar mbarǝm gǝsi, ama mbarǝm gǝsi nǝm ti da'a. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Ama munju kup kan nǝm ti, munju kan ngǝsh wur den sun gǝso, tǝ bi wur bi kǝ dǝmi mimir kǝ Yam wi. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Ba'e mimir ju kan gǝri gǝzǝn nǝra kandatu mbarǝm ba gǝri, ko kǝ ba metǝn kǝ gǝr na kosi, ko kǝ ndu'i kǝ mbarǝm gwa da'a, ama gǝri kǝ Yam ni.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Kalmayi palka mbarǝme kan tǝ dǝm gip dlom gǝmi. Mǝ shin ɗǝɗatǝn gǝsi, ɗǝɗatǝn kǝ nya nǝm tonngǝlan kǝ Yam kan bom, muntu ɗǝl sur kar Bǝbayi gwa, laa'i na zo mbatl kǝ Yam na ge shirǝmi.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />(Yohana shirǝm den ti. Tǝ tli yar yam tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Muntu ni'e mbarǝm tu kan a wule, &lt;Mǝn ɗirtǝn den kaar da'ǝmi manǝmi, domici tǝra kapǝn dǝ gǝri mi. <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Tǝp kar laa'i zo mbatl gǝs ni mǝ zam zo mbatl gon ra den goni. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Domici kulciwo tǝp kar Musa ni bi, ama zo mbatl kǝ Yam na ge shirǝm ɗir ni tǝp kar Yesu Almasihu. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Murgon ra kan bot shini Yam gwa da'a, ama nya gǝs nǝmi kan bom, muntu kan ti ni'e Yam kan ra na Bǝbayi gwa, ti ni tǝ gode mi Yami.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohana wule ti ni'e Almasihu da'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Seda kǝ Yohana ikǝn nan mǝn Yahuda kǝ Urshalima kar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam na mǝn gǝsgal kǝ Lawi kǝ wu ngen momi den ko ti woni gwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Tǝ nge yari da'a, ama tǝ ɓul bi tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ami ni'e Almasihu da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Wu ngen momi kar ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;To ki ni'e wowe? Ki ni'e Iliya ya?&gt;&gt; Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ami ni da'a.&gt;&gt; Wu wul ti'e,&lt;&lt;Ki ni'e mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam tu ya?&gt;&gt; Ar ni tǝ nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;O'o.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Kan wu pa'i na wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Ki ni'e wowe? Yari mi argon tu kan mii bali munju kan kar mi ɗir gwa. Unun kǝ wul gam gi rawe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yohana bali wur gip shirǝm kǝ mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam Ishaya tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ami ni'e yar mǝn latǝn bi gip lǝpe, &lt;Kǝrkǝmi ni guntǝp Babom ar dǝm sat.&gt; &gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ishaya 40.3</char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Ar ni mǝn Parise jen kan kar wur gwa <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />ngen momi kar Yohana wu wule, &lt;&lt;Kan unun kem kǝ pi mbarǝm batisma nan ki ni'e Almasihu ko Iliya, ko mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam tu da gwa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yohana nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A pini mbarǝm batisma na male, ama gip kǝno gon ra kan kǝ mom ti da gwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Ti ni'e muntu kan ba ɗir kaar da'ǝmi, muntu zap kaptǝlan gǝs ma a kǝm pǝtli da gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Muntu kup pini gip nye bǝn kǝ Betanya den kǝti bi ɓula kǝ Urdun, las tu kan Yohana den pi mbarǝm batisma gwa.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni'e nye Tǝm kǝ Yami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Bar tlowo ar ni Yohana shin Yesu den tertǝn kar ti, kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Shin ni nye tǝm kǝ Yami, muntu kan ra na warwat pitǝn kǝ mbarǝm kǝ atl kundǝrǝndlip gam da ti gwa! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Ti ni'e muntu kan a shirǝm den ti gwa nan a wule, &lt;Mǝn ɗirtǝn den kaar da'ǝmi manǝmi, domici tǝra kapǝn dǝ gǝri mi.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Kup na ami na gam gǝn ma a mom ti da'a, ama argon tu kem a ɗir ami den pi mbarǝm batisma na mal gwa ni'e kǝ dǝ mom ti ra gip Isra'ila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Kan Yohana ba bi seda'e, &lt;&lt;A shin ruhu kǝ Yam den surtǝn na dli wule kǝ kuɓuri kan ba dlǝr den ti. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Faro, a mom ti da'a, ama muntu kan karǝm kǝ pi batisma na mali yarim'e, &lt;Mbarǝm tu kan kǝ shin Ruhu sur kan ba dǝm den ti ni'e muntu kan baa pi mbarǝm batisma na Ruhu kǝ Yam gwa.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />A shin wi kan a yari den'e muntuwo Nya Yam ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mir mǝn kulci kar Yesu kǝ pari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Bar tlo eso Yohana ra dlor na rop gip mir mǝn kulci kar ti. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Nan tǝ shin Yesu den wucetǝno, ar ni tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Shin ni! Nye Tǝm kǝ Yam ta!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Nan mir mǝn kulci kar ti ropi kum tǝ yari untuwo, ar ni wu kop Yesu kaari. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu bali ger kaaro ar ni tǝ shin wur den kopi gǝsi, kan tǝ ngen momi kar wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Unun kǝ ndu we?&gt;&gt; Ar ni wu wule, &lt;&lt;Rabbi, (Ba mǝn kulci ituwi), a ko ni kǝ dǝm we?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ɗir shin ni.&gt;&gt; Ar ni wu ri nan ti kan wu shin las tu tǝ dǝm gwa, wokociyiwo bar kǝ gǝlla am wupse ni kǝ siti, kan wu pa'i nde pǝt nan ti.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Andǝrawus, erǝm kǝ Siman Bitǝrus ni'e nǝm gip ropi kan kum argon tu Yohana yari kan wu kop Yesu gwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Argon tu Andǝrawus pare piwo ar ni'e, tǝ zam erǝm gǝs Siman kan tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Mǝ zam Almasihu wi&gt;&gt; (Zǝzari kǝ Yam ituwi). <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Kan tǝ ɗir nan ti kar Yesu. Ar ni Yesu shin ti, kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ki ni'e Siman nya Yohana. Baa la ki bi'e Kepas&gt;&gt; (na bi gono Bitǝrus, tat ituwi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kepas (na bi kǝ mǝn Arameik ni) kano Bitǝrus (na bi mǝ mǝn Hellas) kup rop juwo tat ni ar ba pi nupi.</char></note>).<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la bi Filibus na Natanayilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Bar tlowo, ar ni Yesu pǝn gip mbatl gǝs den'e tii ndara Galili. Ar ni tǝ zam Filibus, kan tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kopǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filibus nye mǝn Betsaida ni, bǝn kǝ ga Andǝrawus na Bitǝrus. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filibus zam Nataniyel kan tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Mǝ zam mbarǝm tu kan Musa mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam rǝsh den ti gip tǝlankur kulci gǝs gwawi, muntu kan ga mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam ma rǝsh den ti gwa'e, Yesu kǝ Nazarat, nya Isubu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Nataniyel ngen momi tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Baa mani zami ho bar gon gip Nazarata?&gt;&gt; Filibus wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ɗir kǝ shini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Nan Yesu shin Nataniyel den tertǝno, ar ni tǝ shirǝm den ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ho nye mǝn Isra'ilan kǝni, muntu kan setǝn ra gip pitǝn gǝs da gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Nataniyel ngen momi kar ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Im ni kǝ momǝn rawu?&gt;&gt; Yesu nǝmi ti'e, &lt;&lt;A shin ki nan ki ra gǝs kin turum kapǝn dǝ Filibus la ki bi gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Kan Nataniyel ba wul Yesu'e, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, ki ni'e Nya Yami! Ki ni'e Gun kǝ Isra'ila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu wul Nataniyel'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ ngǝsh ki ni demǝn nan a yari'i den a shin ki gǝs kin turum gwa ya? Kii shin kiri bar ju kan man muntu gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Ar ni tǝ pa wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Na ho bi ni a yari ine, kii shin dlom yam ɓuli, na mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam den totǝn na surtǝn den<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pare pi bari 28.12</char></note> Nya Mbarǝme.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesu pali koni mal dǝm njeti mal Inabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Den pǝt kǝ myakano nyel gudlumi ra gip bǝn kǝ Kana gip kǝti atl kǝ Galili. Nasi Yesu ra lasi, <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Yesu na mir mǝn kulci kar ti ma la wur bi kǝ ba gudlumiyi. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Nan mal kin inabi gǝzǝn pakawo, ar ni nasi Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Wu'i na mal kin inabi da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesu bali ti tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Nǝna, unun kem kǝ ɗir karǝm rawe? Wokoci gǝn piwi da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Ar ni nas wul mǝn pi mbapi'e, &lt;&lt;Pi ni argon tu kup tǝ yari in gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Kosak na lasiwo kiri ran kǝ tat jen ra guduli mukka, nari ni mǝn Yahuda ba pi mbap ju kan Yam ba nǝm gwa tǝp kǝ ba hotǝne, ko gonge gip tati ba mani shoti ti mal bar kǝ tat mal mukka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bar kǝ galan hauya nǝm na kutl ko lita hauya nantam.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Ar ni Yesu wul ga mǝn pi mbapi'e, &lt;&lt;Laa'i ni ran ju na male.&gt;&gt; Kan wu la'i har bisi.<verse eid="JHN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Kan Yesu ba wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝkǝno nge ni kǝ ri ni mbarǝm tu kan ne ti gam nyeli gwa.&gt;&gt; Ar ni wu pi untuyi, <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />kan mbarǝm tu ne gam nyeli ba ɓom mali kan palika mal inabi gwa. Tǝ mom las tu ar ɗǝl gwa da'a, mǝn mbap ju kan nge mali gwa ni momi. Kan tǝ la bi ba mǝn gudlumiyi markǝme <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ko gonge mbarǝm ba ɗǝli ni mal inabi kan mani tǝmtǝn gwa kakani, den kaariwo kan dǝ ɗǝli muntu kan ri mǝntayi da'a wokoci tu mǝndǝkiyi tla ar kǝm wur wi gwa, ama kiwo kǝ ne muntu mani tǝmtǝn gwa se kǝkǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Muntu ni'e halama bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn kǝ Yesu kǝ nǝm, tǝ pini muntu gip bǝn kǝ Kana gip kǝti atl kǝ Galili. Na untu ni tǝ gode ɗǝɗatǝn gǝsi, kan mir mǝn kulci kar ti ba ngǝsh wur den ti.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kar mǝn wuri barka gip bom kǝ Yami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Den kaar kǝ untuwo, ar ni Yesu ndara Kaparnahum nan ti na nase na mir mǝn gǝpi gǝs na mir mǝn kulci kar ti. Wu dǝm suka kǝ mir muri jeni.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Nan wokoci Nyel Jikat Bǝdlabǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda piwo, ar ni Yesu to gǝs Urshalima. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Te gip dǝbom bom kǝ Yam kawo, ar ni tǝ zam mbarǝm den ta wuri ga tla, tǝm na kuɓǝrka, kan na jen njon den tebǝr wu den bali wurpi. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Ar ni tǝ miri zap tǝ pi rǝɓa nari, kan tǝ kar wurka gip bom kǝ Yami, kup na tǝm na tlayi, kan tǝ jirkǝt ga tebǝr gǝzǝnka tǝ wi ge wurpi kǝ mǝn bali wurpiyika. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Ar ni tǝ wul munju kan ba wur ga kuɓǝrika gwa'e, &lt;&lt;Ɗǝli ni bar ju ɗeka! Ba kǝ pali ni bom kǝ Ban ka ba bar pǝt da'a!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti dami den ar ra na rǝshi gip shirǝm kǝ Yam'e, &lt;&lt;Ghuve kǝ ndu'i bom gi baa cim mbatl naari.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zabura 69.9</char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Ar ni kiri kǝ mǝn Yahuda ngen momi wu wule, &lt;&lt;Unu bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn ni kii pi kan baa gode iko gi kǝ pi bar tu gwawu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Yas ni bom kǝ Yam kǝnka, ami ngapo aa tu lasi gip muri myakan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Mǝn Yahudayi bali ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ar pǝn sheti ghon hauya rop na mukka kan ba'i pa'i tu'i bom kǝ Yam kǝni, ama kǝ ri kǝ tu'i gǝs ra lasi gip muri myakana?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Ama bom kǝ Yam tu Yesu ba shirǝm denewo dli gǝs ni. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Den kaar kǝ tli gǝska gip mǝshi mbarǝm ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti dami argon tu tǝ yari gwa. Kano wu ngǝsh wur den shirǝm kǝ Yam kan ra na rǝshi na shirǝm ju Yesu yari gwa.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Nan Yesu ra gip bǝn Urshalima wokoci kǝ Nyel Jikat Bǝdlabǝno, ar ni mbarǝm na womti shin bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn ju tǝ den pi gwa kan wu ngǝsh wur den ti.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sun gǝsi</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Ama Yesu ne dli den wur da'a, domici tǝ mom mbarǝm kup. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Tǝ pa ndu dǝ mbarǝm yari ti argon den nya mbarǝm da'a, domici tǝ mom argon tu gip mbatl kǝ ko gonge mbarǝm gwa.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Nikodimu ri kar Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Mbarǝm gon ra gip mǝn Parise, mǝn sun'e Nikodimu, tǝra nǝm gip mǝn domtǝn kǝ kiri kǝ mǝn Yahuda. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Ar ni mbarǝmi ɗir kar Yesu gip gasi kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, mǝ mom ki mǝn kulci mbarǝm kan ɗǝl sur kar Yam gwa ni. Domici murgon ra kan baa mani pi halama bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am ju kan kǝ pi gwa da'a Yam ni ra nan ti da gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ge shirǝm ni a yari'i, o gǝr ki ni es<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">gǝr ki ni esi: Kandatu bali gip rǝshi jeno ar ni'e, &lt;&lt;Se in gǝr ki ni sur yam gwa.&gt;&gt;</char></note> dawo, kii shin mulki kǝ Yam da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodimu ngen momi kar ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Imnu baa pa mani gǝri mbarǝm kan korsika gwawu? Rawo, tii mani paltǝn te gip tu dǝ naska dǝ gǝr ti ra dak!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ge shirǝm ni a yari'i, ko nǝm murgon ra kan baa te gip mulki kǝ Yam da'a, e gǝr tǝni tǝp kǝ ba mal na ruhu da gwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Mbarǝmo, mbarǝm ni tǝ gǝri, Ruhu ngapo Ruhu ni tǝ gǝri. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Ba dǝ argon tu a yari'i'e, &lt;Ar nǝm mbarǝm te yarka dǝ gǝr ti esi&gt; dǝmi'i bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am da'a. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Itǝr ba bǝtl ni gam las tu ar ndu kopi gwa. Kǝ kum wultǝn gǝsi, ama kii mani yari las tu ar ɗǝl ɗir na las tu ar ba ri gwa dak. Untu ni ar ra na ko gonge mbarǝm tu kan Ruhu ni gǝr ti <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gip bi kǝn Hellaso na Ruhu na itǝr, kup sun nǝm ni.</char></note>gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Ar ni Nikodimu pa ngen momi kar Yesu tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Imni untu baa pi rawu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Kan Yesu ba nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Bar mǝn kulci mbarǝm kǝ Isra'ila ni'e ki, ama kǝ mani momi bar ju da'a ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Ge shirǝm ni a yari'i'e mǝ yari ni argon tu mǝ mom gwa, kan mǝ shirǝm ni den argon tu mǝ shin gwa, ama kup na untu kǝ nge nǝmi argon tu mǝ yari in kagwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />A shirǝm ni nan kǝn den bar ju kan kǝ atl ni gwa ama kǝ nǝm da'a, imni kii nǝm ami ni a yari in bar ju kan kǝ to yamka ni gwawu? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Murgon ra kan taɓe totǝn yam gwa da'a se de Nya Mbarǝm kan ɗǝl sur yam gwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Kandatu Musa tli ici ka zili gǝlla den dlo gip lǝpo, untu ni ar nǝm dǝ tli Nya Mbarǝm yami, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />kǝ dǝ muntu kup ngǝsh ti den tiwo, tǝ zam ge mbatl tu kan baa pa dagwa.<verse eid="JHN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />&lt;&lt;Domici Yam ndu atl kundǝrǝndlip naaro, ar ni tǝ bi nya gǝs nǝm kan ra bom gwa, den'e muntu kup ngǝsh den tiwo, ba dǝ tǝ liika katl da'a ama tǝ zam ge mbatl tu kan baa pa dagwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Domici Yam kar ni nya gǝs sur atl kǝ dǝ tǝ hukunte atl kundǝrǝndlip da'a, ama kǝ dǝ mbarǝm den kaar atl kundǝrǝndlip zam ɗǝltǝn ra tǝp kar ti. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Murgon tu kup ngǝsh den Nya Yamo baa tloyi ti shirǝm da'a, ama muntu kup ngǝsh den ti dawo, tare tloyi ti shirǝm wi domici tǝ ngǝsh ti den sun kǝ Nya Yam kan ne ti nǝm kan ra bom gwa da'a. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Tloyi shirǝmi ni'e cirtǝn ɗir gip atl kundǝrǝndlip wi, ama mbarǝm ndu dǝmǝnka man cirtǝni, domici pitǝn gǝzǝno kǝ ɗasi tu ni. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Murgon tu kup ba pi bar kǝ ɗasi tu'o tǝ nge ni cirtǝni, kan tii ndu ɗirtǝn kar cirtǝn da'a, bǝse dǝ pitǝn gǝs ɗǝlka den kaari. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Ama kup mǝn pitǝn koro, tǝ ɗir ni kar cirtǝni, kǝ dǝ shin ra hoyi den'e argon tu tǝ piwo, tǝ pi ni gip kopi shirǝm kǝ Yami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shirǝm kǝ Yohana mǝn pi batisma den Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Den kaar kǝ untuwo, ar ni Yesu na mir mǝn kulci kar ti ndara kǝti atl kǝ Yahuda, las tu kan tǝ ɓom dǝmi nan wur gwa, tǝ den pi mbarǝm batisma. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Wokociyiwo Yohana ra den pi mbarǝm batisma gip Ainon kan ra kosak na Salim, nan mal ra na naari lasi gwa, kan mbarǝm ba pi ta ɗirtǝn ba pi wur batisma. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Muntu pi ni kapǝn dǝ la Yohana gip bom moni. <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Kan shirǝm ba gadlǝrka gip dlom kǝ mir mǝn kulci kar Yohana na mǝn Yahuda goni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gip kor rǝshi tulankuri jen na amo &lt;&lt;Mǝn Yahuda jen&gt;&gt; ni lasi.</char></note> den shirǝm kǝ al'ada hotǝn ju kan mǝn Yahuda ba pi kǝ dǝmi dlǝran den bi doka gǝzǝn gwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Ar ni wu ɗir kar Yohana kan wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, mbarǝm tu kan ra nan ki den kǝti ɓula Jodan, muntu kan kǝ bi seda den ti gwa, tin tu den pi batisma pa'e, mbarǝm ngap den ta ritǝn kar ti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Den muntuwo ar ni Yohana bali wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm baa mani ni zami argon tu kan bi ti sur yam gwa katl. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Kǝn na gam gin kii mani yari den'e a wule, &lt;Ami ni'e Almasihu da'a, ama karǝm ni cina da ti.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Pel gǝro kǝ Ba mǝn pel gudlumi ni. Bar berǝm kǝ mǝn pel gudlumiyi ba ɓut ni kǝ dǝ tǝ kum yar kǝ Ba mǝn pel gudlumiyi. Ti ni tǝ kum yar kǝ Ba mǝn pel gudlumiyiwo, tǝ laa'i na ghol mbatl naari. Tǝp untu ni a pi ghol mbatl hoyi. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Ar nǝm dǝ mbarǝm tu pi ta naartǝni, ami ngapo a pi ta catǝnka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muntu kan ɗǝl sur Yam gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />&lt;&lt;Ti muntu kan ɗǝl sur yamo, tǝ naar man kup ka. Muntu kup kan atl ni tǝ ɗǝlo kǝ atl ni tǝra, kan tǝ shirǝm ni den bar ju kan kǝ atl ni gwa. Ti muntu kan ɗǝl sur yamo tǝ naar man kup ka. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Tǝ shirǝm ni den argon tu tǝ kum kan tǝ pal tǝ shin gwa, ama kup na untu murgon kan ra nǝm argon tu tǝ yari gwa da'a. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Ama muntu kup nǝm shirǝmiwo, tǝ tabbate wi den'e Yam mǝn dlǝri den shirǝm gǝs ni. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Domici muntu kan Yam kar suro, shirǝm kǝ Yam ni tǝ yari, nan Yam bi ti ni Ruhu gǝs baa patǝn gwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Bǝbayi ba ndu Nyayi, ar ni tǝ bi bar kup gip am gǝsi. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Muntu kup ci cina gip ngǝshtǝn den Nyayiwo tǝra na ge mbatl tu kan baa pa da gwa. Ama muntu kup nge Nyayiwo, tii zam ge mbatl tu kan baa pa da'i da'a, se lo kǝ Yam kan ra den gam gǝs gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na nagǝr mǝn Samariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Mǝn Parise kum den'e Yesu den pi mbarǝm batisma na zami mir mǝn kulci kar ti man Yohana, <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />kup na Yesu na gam gǝs ni ba pi batismayi da'a, ama mir mǝn kulci kar ti ni den pi. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Nan Babom Yesu kum muntuwo, tǝ za atl kǝ Yahudaka kan tǝ pal na kaar tǝ te gip atl kǝ Galili.<verse eid="JHN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Ra untuwo ar nǝm tǝ kop gip kǝti atl kǝ Samariya. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Ar ni tǝ mbubar gip bǝn kǝ mǝn Samariya gon kan ba la ti bi'e Sika, kosak na atl tu kan Yakubu bi nya gǝs Isubu gwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Shu mal kǝ Yakubu ra lasi. Nan ar banyi Yesu na ɓomi asǝmo, ar ni tǝ dǝm atl den bi shu mali. Wokociyiwo pǝt to dlom yam wi.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Ar ni nagǝr mǝn Samariya gon ɗir kǝ nge male, ar ni Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Bim mal ngap a tla.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />(Mir mǝn kopi gǝs te gip bǝn kǝ wuri fingali.)<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Nagǝr mǝn Samariyayi wul Yesu'e, &lt;&lt;Ki mǝn Yahuda ni, kan amo nagǝr mǝn Samariya ni. Imnu kǝ lirim mal rawu?&gt;&gt; (Domici mǝn Yahuda ba mo gam kǝ ba lasi nǝm na mǝn Samariya da'a.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Domici mǝn Yahuda ba mo gam kǝ ba lasi nǝm na mǝn Samariya da'a: Ba bali shirǝm tu'e &lt;&lt;Mǝn Yahuda ba tla bar gip gal nǝm na mǝn Samariya da'a.&gt;&gt; </char></note>)<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;O na kǝ mom ni bi bar kǝ Yami na muntu kan ba lir ki maliwo, na kǝ lir ti tǝ bi'i mal mǝn bi ge mbatl wi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Nagǝr mbarǝmi wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝn nartǝni, ki ra na bar kǝ dǝli mali da'a kan shu mali dlyam ngap. Ako ni kii zam mal mǝn bi ge mbatl tuwe? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Rawo kǝ man ni kori gǝmi Yakubu, muntu kan za'i mi shu mali kan tǝ tla mali na gam gǝs, mimir gǝs ma wu tla kup na ga dabba gǝsa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Murgon tu kup tla mal kǝno, tii pa kum guzum mal ra, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />ama murgon tu kup tla mal tu a biwo, ti'i kum guzum mal ra da'a. Mal tu kan aa bi ti baa dǝm ger mal gip ti kan baa pi ta ɗǝltǝn ar ri zami ge mbatl tu kan baa pa da gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Nagǝr mǝri wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Babomi, bim mal tu ngapi, kan guzum mal baa pi ta kemi gǝn kǝ ɗirtǝn ɗe kǝ nge mal da gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ri la bi bakos gi kǝ ɗir ni nan ti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Ar ni nagǝr mǝri bali ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ami na kos da'a.&gt;&gt; Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ yari dlat nan kǝ wule ki na kos da gwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Ge shirǝm ni kǝ yari. Kǝ pi moni nantam, kan mbarǝm tu ki ra nan ti kǝkǝn ma kos gi ni da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Nagǝr mǝri wule &lt;&lt;Mǝn nartǝni, a shino ki mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam ni. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Ga kori gǝmi bote Yam den tlǝndǝr tu. Ama kǝn mǝn Yahuda wule gip bǝn Urshalima ni ndari dǝ mbarǝm bote Yami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Nagǝr mbarǝme, ngǝsh ki demǝni, wokoci ra den ɗirtǝn nan kii bote Bǝba ba'e den tlǝndǝr tu ko su Urshalimaka da'a. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Kǝn mǝn Samariya ba bote ni argon tu kǝ mom dagwa. Ama min mǝn Yahudawo, mǝ bote ni argon tu mǝ mom gwa, domici zami ɗǝltǝno tǝp kar mǝn Yahuda ni ar ɗiri. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Ama wokoci ra den ɗirtǝne, kǝkǝn ma ar ɗir wi nan mǝn pi bota hoyi ba bote Bǝba gip Ruhu na ho mbatl gwa, domici badǝr mbarǝm ju ni Bǝba ba ngen wu bote ti. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Yamo Ruhu ni, rawo ar nǝm dǝ munju ba bote tiwo, wu bote ti gip ruhu na ho mbatli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Ar ni nagǝr mǝri wule, &lt;&lt;A mom'e Almasihu (kan ba la ti bi'e Kǝristi) den ɗirtǝne. Wokoci tu tǝ mbǝrawo, tii ceti mi gamka den bar kup.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Ar ni Yesu yari ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ami mǝn shirǝm nan ki kǝn ni'e ti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mir mǝn kulci kar Yesu pa mo nan tiwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Wi gip shirǝmo se mir mǝn kulci kar ti ba pali, ar ni ar dǝmi wur bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am nan wu zam ti den shirǝm na gǝr mǝtli gwa. Ama ko nǝm gon ngen momi kar nagǝr mǝri da'a tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Unun kǝ ndu'i?&gt;&gt; Ko dǝ gon wul Yesu'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kem kǝ shirǝm nan tiwu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Ar ni nagǝr mǝri za tat mal gǝs lasi, tǝ pal te gip bǝnka tǝ wul mbarǝm'e, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />&lt;&lt;Ɗir shin ni mbarǝm tu kan yarim bar ju kup a pi gwa. Ko ti ni'e Almasihuyi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Ar ni mbarǝm ɗǝl ter gip bǝni wu ne gam kar Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Gip untuwo ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti lir ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, ci fingali.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Ama Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ami ra na fingal tu kan kǝ mom argon dene da gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar tiyi wul ezǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Rawo murgon ɗiri tǝni fingala?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Ama Yesu wule, &lt;&lt;Fingal gǝn ni'e a pi argon tu muntu kan karǝm sur ba ndu a pi gwa, kan a pa pa'i mbap gǝsi. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Kǝ kur wule, &lt;Ar sawi kyar wupse dǝ rǝsh kǝn diya?&gt; A yari in den kǝ ɓul ni ger gin kǝ shin ni bar kǝ gip kǝne! Wu nyo wi den bi rǝshi. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Kǝkǝn tu ma nye mǝn pi mbap den zami ɓatltǝn gǝs wi, ti den rǝshi bar kǝ kǝn tǝ den ri gip ge mbatl tu kan baa pa da gwa, kǝ dǝ mǝn ngani na mǝn rǝshi kup pi ghol mbatli. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Ra untuwo, shirǝm tu'e, &lt;Gon ngani kan gon ba rǝsho&gt; untu ni ar ra. <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />A kar kǝn kǝ rǝsh argon tu kǝn ni kǝ pi mbapi da gwa. Jen ni pi mbap hoyi, kan kǝno kǝ zam ra gip mbap gǝzǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝn Samariya na womti ngǝsh wur den Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Na womti kǝ mǝn Samariya kan gip bǝn ta ngǝsh wur den Yesu den argon tu kan nagǝr mǝri yari gwa'e, &lt;&lt;Tǝ yarim bar ju kup a pi gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Nan mǝn Samariyayi ɗir kar tiwo, ar ni wu lir ti den tǝ dǝm nan wur ngapi, kan tǝ dǝm kǝ muri rop. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Mbarǝm na womti ngǝsh wur den Yesu den shirǝm gǝsi.<verse eid="JHN 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Ar ni wu wul nagǝr mǝri'e, &lt;&lt;Ba'e mǝ nǝm ni den argon tu kǝ yari katl gwa da'a ama kǝkǝno mǝ kum wi na gam gǝmi, kan mǝ mom wi den mbarǝm tu ni'e Mǝn ɗǝli mbarǝm kǝ atl kundǝrǝndlip.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu warke nya bar mbarǝm goni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Den kaar kǝ muri ropiwo ar ni tǝ za kǝti atl kǝ Samariya tǝ ndara Galili. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />(Yesu tare yari wur wi den'e ba shin nartǝn kǝ mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam gip bǝn gǝs da'a.) <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Nan tǝ mbubar gip Galiliwo, mǝn Galiliyi pi ti ɗem na ɗirtǝne. Wu shin bar ju kup tǝ pi gwa gip Urshalima wokoci kǝ Nyel Jikat Bǝdlabǝni, domici wu ma wu ra lasi.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Kan tǝ pa te gip bǝn kǝ Kana kan ra gip atl kǝ Galili, las tu kan tǝ pali koni mal ka mal inabi gwa. Lasiwo nya bar mbarǝm gon ra den kumi dli gip Kaparnahum. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Nan mbarǝm tu kum'e Yesu za atl kǝ Yahuda tǝ cwat gip Galiliwo, ar ni tǝ ri lir ti den dǝ tǝ ri warke nya gǝs nye moni, muntu kan ra bi dǝ mǝshtǝn gwa.<verse eid="JHN 4:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝn ni kǝ shin bar kǝ halama na bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn dawo, kii ngǝsh kǝn den Yam da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Bar mbarǝmi lir Yesu tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝn nartǝni, sur kapǝn dǝ nya gǝn mǝshka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu bali ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ndara, nya gi baa sa ra na ge mbatli.&gt;&gt; Mbarǝmi nǝm shirǝm kǝ Yesu kan tǝ ndara. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Nan tǝ'i den tǝpo ar ni zher gǝs jen mbor ti na shirǝm den'e nya gǝs pal gingǝlǝn wi. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Nan tǝ ngen momi wokoci tu kumi dli kǝ nyayi pa'o, ar ni zher gǝsi wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ghur bar kǝ gǝlla nǝm kǝ pǝt ni kumi dliyi za ti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Ar ni bas mom'e wokociyi ni Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Nya gi ba sa ra na ge mbatli.&gt;&gt; Ar ni mbarǝmi na mbarǝm kǝ shu bom gǝs kup ngǝsh wur den Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Muntu ni'e halama bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am kǝ rop kan Yesu pi nan tǝ za gip atl kǝ Yahuda tǝ mbubar gip atl kǝ Galili gwa.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu warke kurki gon bi male</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Den kaariwo, ar ni Yesu to Urshalima kǝ nyel gon kǝ mǝn Yahuda. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Kosak na Bǝdlabǝn Tǝm kan gip Urshalimawo shu gurku mal gon ra, muntu kan na bi kǝ mǝn Aram ba la ti bi'e Betesda gwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gip tǝlankuri jeno Betzata ni. Nami tǝlankuriwo ngapo Betseda</char></note>, lasi ra na gandǝli na kop gudǝli nantam. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Lasi ni ba ne mbarǝm na womti kan kǝti dli gǝzǝn ra hoyi da'a, ga tabi, na kurki, na munju kǝtǝ dli gǝzǝn itǝr tlaka gwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Wu ɓut ni kǝ dǝ gudǝr mali. Domici mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam ba kur sur gip mali, tǝ gudǝri. Ar ba dǝm'e muntu kup kan zho ti kǝ la'i asǝm gip mali kan gudǝri gwa ba zam warketǝn den argon tu kan ba ghun ti gwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Gon ra lasi kan den kumi dli kǝ sheti ghon hauya nǝm na kutl cet wuzupse gwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Nan Yesu shin ti ɓomo, tǝ mom'e untu ni tǝra den kumi dli kǝ tlyari wokoci, ar ni Yesu ngen momi kar ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝ ndu kǝ pal lauwa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Mbarǝmi kan ba kum tǝmi kǝ dli gǝs da'ayi nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, ami ra na murgon kan baa nem am a su gip mali gwa da'a wokoci tu gudǝr mali gwa. Ami ni den kǝrce kǝ sitǝn gipiwo, se dǝ gon ɓotlka demǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Ar ni Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Tlyami! Pǝn bamuri gi kǝ ndara.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Ar ri kǝtigon da'a, ar ni mbarǝmi warke, kan tǝ pǝn bamuri gǝs tǝ ndara. Den pǝt Asabar pǝt shukǝtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda ni muntu pi. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Ar ni mǝn Yahudayi wul mbarǝmi kan Yesu warke tiyi gwa'e,&lt;&lt;Sekǝno pǝt shukǝtǝn ni, den Kulci kǝ Musawo ar ndari kǝ pǝn bamuri gi da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Ama tǝ bali wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm tu kan palim lau gwa ni wulǝm'e, &lt;Pǝn bamuri gi kǝ ndara.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Ar ni wu ngen momi kar ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Wo ni'e mbarǝm tu kan wul ki'e kǝ pǝn bamuri gi kǝ ndara gwayi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Mbarǝmi kan warke ti gwa mom wo ni warke tiyi da'a, nan Yesu jilka gip womti mbarǝm kan ra lasi gwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Den kaariwo ar ni Yesu zam ti te gip bom kǝ Yamka kan tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Shin ca, kǝ pal lau wi. Za pi warwat pitǝne, bǝse dǝ wani bar gon kan man muntu gwa zam ki.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Ar ni mbarǝmi ndara kan tǝ yari kiri kǝ mǝn Yahudayi'e Yesu ni pali ti lau.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Ar dǝm'e, nan Yesu ba pi ni bar ju den pǝt shukutǝno, ar ni mǝn Yahudayi pare sanante ti. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ban den ta pi mbap ko gigasi har sekǝni, untuni ami den pi pa'e.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Den shirǝm tuwo ar ni mǝn Yahudayi meti ra gip ngeni ri gǝs eka, wu wule ba'e den warke mbarǝm den pǝt shukutǝn ni katl da'a ama den'e tǝ den la'i bi Yam'e bas ni, tǝ pali gam gǝs nǝm na Yam ituwi.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iko tu Yesu Nya Yam ra nari gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ge shirǝm ni a yari in'e Nyayi ba pi argon kǝ gam gǝs da'a, se de argon tu tǝ shin bas den pi gwa, domici kup argon tu Bǝbayi ba piwo ar ni Nyayi ba pi pa'e.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Rawo Bǝbayi ba ndu Nyayi kan tǝ gode ti ni bar ju kup tǝ pi gwa. Aan, kǝ dǝ kǝ nǝm bi na amo, tii gode ti bar ju ma kan naar man munju gwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Domici kandatu Bǝbayi ba tli mǝshi mbarǝm gip gambǝci tǝ bi wur ge mbatl gwa, untu ni Nyayi ba bi ge mbatl muntu kup tǝ ndu'i ti bi gwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Bǝbayi ba tloyi shirǝm murgon da'a, ama tǝ la kup iko kǝ tloyi shirǝm mbarǝm gip am dǝ Nyayi wi, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />kǝ dǝ mbarǝm kup ɗǝɗa Nyayi kandatu ba ɗǝɗa Bǝbayi gwa. Muntu kup ba ɗǝɗa Nyayi dawo, tǝ ɗǝɗa Bǝbayi kan kar ti sur gwa ituwi.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />&lt;&lt;Ge shirǝm ni a yari in den'e murgon tu kup ba kum shirǝm gǝn kan tǝ ngǝsh ti den muntu kan karǝm gwa ra na ge mbatl tu kan baa pa da gwa. Eso, baa hukunte ti da'a, domici tǝ jikat mǝshtǝn tǝ te gip ge mbatl wi. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Ge shirǝm ni a yari ine, wokoci gon den ɗirtǝne, kǝkǝn ma ar ɗir wi, nan mǝshi mbarǝm baa kum yar kǝ Nya Yam gwa, munju kum ngap baa zam dǝmi ra na ge mbatli. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Domici kandatu Bǝbayi na gam gǝs mǝn bi ge mbatl no, untu ni pa tǝ kem dǝ Nyayi dǝm mǝn bi ge mbatli. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Tǝ pa bi ti bi kǝ tloyi mbarǝm shirǝm domici tǝ Nya Mbarǝm ni.<verse eid="JHN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />&lt;&lt;Ba dǝ muntu dlǝkǝn kǝn ni da'a, rawo wokoci gon ra den ɗirtǝn nan kup muntu kan ra mǝshi gip gambǝci baa kum yar gǝs <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />kan wu ɗǝl tori, munju kan pi mbuni baro, wii tlyam wu zam ge mbatli, kan munju kan pi wani baro, wii tli dǝ hukunte wuri. <verse eid="JHN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Aa mani pi argon ami nan gǝn da'a, a tlo ni shirǝm den kandatu Yam wule a pi gwa. Ra untuwo tloyi shirǝm gǝno dlat ni ar ra, nan argon tu a ndu'i gam gǝn ni a pi dagwa, ama kǝ muntu kan karǝm sur gwa ni.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seda den Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />&lt;&lt;Ami ni a shirǝm den gam gǝno, argon tu a yari demǝno baa nǝm da'a. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Gon ra kan ba shirǝm demǝn gwa, kan a mom'e argon tu tǝ yari demǝno untun ar ra.<verse eid="JHN 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />&lt;&lt;Kǝ kar bar den Yohana kano tǝ bi seda den ge shirǝmi. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Ba'e den a nǝm ni argon tu kan mbarǝm ba sede gwa ni da'a. Ama a yari ni den kǝ zam ni ɗǝltǝn ra. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yohana ni'e pitila tu kan pi ta ci kan ba bi cirtǝn gwa, ama kǝ pǝn kǝ kum tǝmi kǝ cirtǝn gǝs kǝ nye wokoci njem katl.<verse eid="JHN 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />&lt;&lt;Ami ra na seda kan man muntu Yohana pi demǝn gwa. Domici mbap ju kan a piwo, Bǝbayi ni bim kǝ dǝ a pi, kan bar ju ami den pi gwa ni ba bi seda den'e Bǝba ni karǝmi. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Kan Bǝbayi kan karǝm na gam gǝs ni'e seda gǝni. Kǝ taɓe kumi yar gǝs ko kǝ shin kandatu tǝra gwa dak, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />eso shirǝm gǝs ra gip mbatl gin da'a, domici kǝ ngǝsh kǝn den muntu kan Bǝbayi kar sur gwa da'a. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Kǝn den ta ngeni gip shirǝm kǝ Yam domici kǝ shin wule gip wuro kii zam ge mbatl tu kan baa pa da gwa. Ama shirǝm kǝ Yam ju ni ba bi seda demǝni. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Ama kup na untu kǝ nge ɗirtǝn karǝm kǝ dǝ kǝ zam ge mbatl ra.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />&lt;&lt;A nǝm ɗǝɗatǝn kǝ mbarǝm da'a. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Ama a mom kǝne. A mom'e kǝn ra na ndu'i Yam gip mbatl gin da'a. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />A sur ni gip iko kǝ Ban, ama kǝ nǝmǝn da'a, ama murgon ni ɗir kǝ gam gǝso, kii nǝm ti. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Imni fa kii ngǝsh kǝn den Yam kǝn ni kǝ ngen ɗǝɗatǝn gip dlom gini, ama kǝ ngen zami ɗǝɗatǝn tu kan ba ɗǝl sur kar Yam muntu kan ti ni nǝm nan gǝs da gwawu?<verse eid="JHN 5:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />&lt;&lt;Ama ba kǝ pǝn ni'e aa ri in cina dǝ Bǝba da'a. Mǝn ri gin cina ni'e Musa, muntu kan kǝ la mbatl den tii ne in am ra gwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Na kǝ ngǝsh kǝn ni den Musawo, kii ngǝsh kǝn demǝn pa'e, domici tǝ rǝsh demǝn gip tǝlankur gǝsi. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Ama kǝn ni kǝ ngǝsh kǝn den argon tu kan tǝ rǝsh gwa dawo, imni fa kii ngǝsh kǝn den shirǝm gǝn we?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ci na moni mbarǝm zangu nantam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Den kaariwo, ar ni Yesu jikat bar ɓula kǝ Galili, bar ɓula kǝ Tiberiya ituwi, <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />kan mbarǝm na womti ba kop ti kaari, domici wu shin halama kǝ bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am ju kan tǝ pi den mǝn kumi dli gwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Wokociyiwo ar ni Yesu to gǝs won gǝs den tlǝndǝr kan tǝ dǝm atl na mir mǝn kulci kar ti. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Wokociyiwo ar sawi njem dǝ pi Nyel Jikat Bǝdlabǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda.<verse eid="JHN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Nan Yesu tli ger tǝ shin mbarǝm na womti ba te kar tiwo, ar ni tǝ wul Filibus'e, &lt;&lt;Ako ni mii wur bǝredi kan mbarǝm ju baa ci gwawe?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Tǝ ngen ni kumi kǝ bi gǝsi, domici tor mbatl gǝso tǝ mom argon tu kan tǝ ri kǝ pi gwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filibus nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Wurpi pi mbap kǝ muri hauya kutl<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gip bi Kǝ Mǝn Hellaso dinari hauya kutl</char></note> ba ri kǝ kǝmi dǝ wur bǝredi tu kan ko gonge gǝzǝn baa zam njem gwa da'a!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Nǝm gip mir mǝn kulci kar ti mǝn sun'e Andǝrawus, erǝm kǝ Bitǝrus, shirǝm tǝ wul Yesu'e, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />&lt;&lt;Nya gon kǝn ra na mir bǝredi nantam kan pi na ɗapti bale<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bale </char><char style="ft" closed="false">balewo ar ni ra wule ge jir dlyari ko alkama</char></note> gwa na mir kos rop, ama unun ar ba pi mbarǝm na womti untuwe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu wul mir mǝn kulci kar tiyi'e, &lt;&lt;Wul ni mbarǝm'e wu dǝm atli.&gt;&gt; Lasiwo jir ra hoyi, kan mbarǝm ba dǝm atli, ama moni kan dǝm atl ri mbarǝm zangu nantam. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Ar ni Yesu pǝn bǝrediyi, tǝ goode Yami, kan tǝ kem ba rabe munju kan dǝm atli gwa kan ar ba kǝm wuri. Untu ni es tǝ pi na kosi.<verse eid="JHN 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Nan kup gǝzǝn ci ar kǝm wuro, ar ni tǝ wul mir mǝn kulci kar ti'e, &lt;&lt;Dom ni roɓǝsi ju kan sa gwa. Ba dǝ za argon ar liika da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti dom roɓǝsi ba laa'i shar kutl cet rop kǝ bǝredi ju kan pi na ɗapti bale nantam ju kan mbarǝm ci wu za gwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Nan mbarǝm shin halama kǝ bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am tu kan Yesu piwo, ar ni wu nǝm wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Na ho bi ni, muntu ni'e mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam tu kan baa cwat den atl gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yesu momka den wu ndu ni'e na ndǝrtǝn kǝ bi gul wu ɗir pali ti gunye, ar ni ti na gam gǝs tǝ dǝlka na kaar tǝ pa to gǝs den tlǝndǝre.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu desi den gam male</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Nan sit piwo, ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti su bi bar ɓula'i, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />las tu wu to gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal kan wu jikat bar ɓula'i wu ndara Kaparnahum gwa. Wokociyiwo dǝmǝn ndawi, ngapo Yesu mbira kar wur wi da'a. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Ar ni bar itǝr gon ɓe tori kan mal bar ɓula'i ba pare zhe'e pitǝne. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Nan wu te den gam mal bar kǝ mil myakan ko wupsewo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ko bar kǝ kilomita nantam ko mukka</char></note> ar ni wu shin Yesu den tertǝn kar kungǝlǝnyi, tǝ den desi den gam male, kan mbatl ba tari wurka. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Ama tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ami ni, kum ni bǝrti da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Kan ar ba gholi wur mbatl kǝ wu pǝn ti gip kungǝlǝn jikat mali. Ar ri kǝtigon da'a kan wu mbubar den bishidi tu kan wu te gwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbarǝm ngen Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Bar tlowo ar ni womti mbarǝmi kan ra den kǝti bishidi bar ɓula'i zamka na momi den'e kungǝlǝn jikat mal nǝm ni katl sa lasi, kan Yesu to gipi na mir mǝn kulci kar ti da'a, ama mir mǝn kulci kar ti ni ndara nan gǝzǝni. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Ar ni kungǝlǝn jikat mal jen kǝ bǝn kǝ Tiberiya ba cwat wu dlǝr kosak na las tu kan mbarǝm ci bǝredi nan Babom Yesu goode Yam gwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Nan womti mbarǝmi momka'e Yesu ko mir mǝn kulci kar ti ra lasi dawo, ar ni wu to gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal wu ndara Kaparnahum kǝ ngeni Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni'e bǝredi mǝn bi ge mbatli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Nan wu zam ti den nǝm kǝti bar ɓula'iwo, ar ni wu ngen momi kar ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, gigasi ni kǝ mbubar ɗewu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ge shirǝm ni a yari ine, kǝn ni den ngeni gǝn, ba'e nan kǝ shin halama kǝ bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am ju a pi gwa ni da'a, ama domici kǝ ci kǝ laa'i tu gin na bǝredi gwa ni. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Ba kǝ pini ta ndotǝn kǝ ngeni fingal kan ba liika gwa da'a, ama den fingal mǝn bi ge mbatl tu kan baa pa dagwa, muntu Nya Mbarǝm baa bi in gwa. Den ti ni Bǝba la am kǝ gode'e tǝ yerda nan ti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Kano wu ngen momi kar ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Unun ar nǝm mi kǝ pi kǝ dǝ mǝ pi mbap tu kan Yam ba ndu gwawe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Argon tu Yam ba ndu'e kǝ piwo ar ni'e kǝ ngǝsh kǝn ni den muntu kan tǝ kar ti sur gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Ar ni wu ngen momi kar ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Unu halama kǝ bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am ni kii pi mi kǝ dǝ mǝ shin kan mǝ ngǝsh mi den ki rawu? Unu arin kii piwe? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Ga kori gǝmi ci manna gip lǝpe, kandatu ar ra na rǝshi gip shirǝm kǝ Yam gwa'e, &lt;Tǝ bi wur bǝredi kan ɗǝl sur yam gwa.&gt; <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɗǝltǝne 16.4, Nehemiya 9.15, Zabura 78.24,25</char></note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Na ho bi ni a yari ine, Musa ni'e muntu kan bi in bǝrediyi kan ɗǝl sur yam gwa da'a, ama Ban ni'e muntu kan bi in ho bǝredi kan ɗǝl sur yam gwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Domici bǝredi kǝ Yamo ti ni'e muntu kan ɗǝl sur yam kan ba bi atl kundǝrǝndlip ge mbatl gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Ar ni wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝn nartǝni, pi mi ta bi bǝredi tu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ami ni'e bǝredi mǝn bi ge mbatli. Muntu kup kan ɗir karǝmo, ti'i kum guzum da'a, kan muntu ngǝsh ti demǝno ti'i kum guzum mal da'a. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Ama kandatu a yari in gwa ni, kǝ shimǝn wi ama kup na untu kǝ nge ngǝshtǝn demǝnka. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Munju kup Bǝba bimo wii ɗir karǝmi, kan muntu kup ɗir karǝmo aa kar tika da'a. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Domici sur yam ni a ɗǝli, ba'e kǝ dǝ a pi argon tu a ndu gwa ni da'a, ama kǝ dǝ a pi argon tu muntu karǝm ba ndu gwa ni. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Kan argon tu muntu karǝm ba ndu gwa ni'e den ba a hol ko nǝm gip munju kan tǝ bim gwa da'a, ama kǝ dǝ a tli wur ra na ge mbatl tu kan baa pa da gwa den pǝt kǝ pa'i bar kup. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Domici argon tu Ban ba ndu gwa itu, den dǝ kup muntu shin Nyayi kan tǝ pi ta ngǝshtǝn den tiwo tǝ zam ge mbatl tu kan baa pa dagwa, ami ngapo aa tli ti den pǝt kǝ pa'i bar kup.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Den untuwo ar ni mǝn Yahudayi nǝm ngwartǝn den ti nan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ami ni'e bǝredi kan ɗǝl sur yam gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Wu wule, &lt;&lt;Yesu ni'e muntu diya, nya Isubu, muntu mǝ mom bas na nas gwa? Imnu kǝkǝno tǝ wul'e, &lt;A dǝl ni sur yam we&gt;?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Za ni ngwartǝn gip dlom gini. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Murgon baa mani ɗirtǝn karǝm da'a se in Bǝba kan karǝm gwa ni dǝl ti ɗir karǝm gwa, kano aa tli ti ra den pǝt kǝ pa'i bar kup. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Ar ra na rǝshi gip tǝlankur kǝ ga mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam'e, &lt;Yam ni baa kulci kup gǝzǝni.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ishaya 54.13</char></note> Murgon tu kup ne kǝm den shirǝm kǝ Bǝba kan tǝ kulci kar ti baa ɗir karǝmi. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Ko nǝm murgon ra kan taɓe shini Bǝbayi gwa da'a, muntu kan ɗǝl sur kar Yam gwa ni katl, ti ni nan gǝs tǝ shin Bǝbayi. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Ge shirǝm ni a yari ine, muntu kup kan ngǝsh ti den Yamo, tǝra na ge mbatl tu kan baa pa da gwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Ami ni'e bǝredi mǝn bi ge mbatli. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Ga kori gin ci manna gip lǝpe, ama kup na untu wu mǝshka. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Ama bǝredi tu kan ɗǝl sur yam gwan kǝni, mbarǝm tu kup ciwo tii mǝshka da'a. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Ami ni'e bǝredi mǝn bi ge mbatl kan ɗǝl sur yam gwa. Muntu kup kan ci bǝredi tuwo, tii zam ge mbatl kan baa pa da gwa. Bǝredi tuwo, tlu dli gǝn ni, muntu kan ari kǝ bi kǝ dǝ atl kundǝrǝndlip zam ge mbatl ra gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Ar ni mǝn Yahudayi nǝm bali shirǝm gip nge kumi ezǝn gip dlom gǝzǝn na wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Imni mbarǝm kǝn baa bi mi dli gǝs mǝ ci wu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ge shirǝm ni a yari ine, kǝn ni kǝ ci tlu dli kǝ Nya Mbarǝm kan kǝ pa tla bǝran gǝs dawo, kǝn ra na ge mbatl gip kǝn da'a. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Muntu kup kan ba ci tlu dli gǝn kan tǝ tla bǝran gǝno, tǝra na ge mbatl tu kan baa pa da gwa, eso aa tli ti den pǝt kǝ pa'i bar kup. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Domici dli gǝno ho tlu ni kan bǝran gǝno ho bar kǝ tle ni. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Muntu kup kan ba ci dli gǝn tǝ pa tla bǝran gǝno tǝra gipǝni, eso ami ra gip ti. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Kandatu Bǝba mǝn ge mbatl karǝm sur kan a pa dǝm ni na ge mbatl domici gǝso, untu ni es muntu kan palim fingal gǝs baa dǝm ra na ge mbatl domici gǝni. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Ami ni'e bǝredi tu kan ɗǝl sur yam gwa. Ga kori gin ci manna kan wu mǝsh ka, ama muntu kan ci bǝredi kǝno tii dǝm ra na ge mbatl kan baa pa da gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Tǝ yari ni muntu nan ti den kulci mbarǝm gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda kan ra gip bǝn kǝ Kaparnahum gwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mir mǝn kopi Yesu na womti za kopi gǝska</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Na kumi untuwo, ar ni na womti gip mir mǝn kopi gǝs wule, &lt;&lt;Banyi kulci ni'e muntu, wo ni baa mani nǝmi we?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Nan Yesu mom'e mǝn kopi gǝs den ngwartǝn den kulci tu tǝ piwo, ar ni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kulci tu dǝmi in nika bar kǝ tli mbatla? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Im ni baa dǝmi ine kǝn ni kǝ shin Nya Mbarǝm den totǝn las tu tǝ ɗǝl sur gwawu? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Ruhu ni ba bi ge mbatl kan baa pa da gwa, dli baa mani pi argon da'a. Shirǝm ju a yari ino Ruhu ni na ge mbatli. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Kup na untuwo, jen gip kǝn ngǝsh wur den Yam da'a.&gt;&gt; Domici na pare baro Yesu mom munju kan ngǝsh wur den ti da'a na muntu kan ba ri kǝ bali ti kaar gwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Tǝ ci cina na wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Ar ni kem a yari in'e murgon ra kan baa ɗir karǝm gwa da'a se Bǝba ni bii ti mani pi untuyi gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Den kaar kǝ yari shirǝm tuwo ar ni na womti gip mir mǝn kopi gǝs dǝlka na kaari, wu za kopi gǝsi.<verse eid="JHN 6:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Ar ni Yesu ngen momi kar kutl cet ropi, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝn ma kǝ ndu ni'e kǝ ndara ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Siman Bitǝrus nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, kar wo ni mi riwe? Ki ni'e mǝn shirǝm bi ge mbatl tu kan baa pa da gwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Mǝ ngǝsh mi den ki wi, mǝ pa mom wi'e ki ni'e Dlǝranyi kǝ Yami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Kan Yesu ba bali wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ami ni a zǝzar kǝn kutl cet ropi diya? Kup na untu nǝm gip kǝno shetan ni!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />(Yahuda nya Siman Iskariyoti ni tǝ shirǝm den ti, muntu ba ri kǝ bi gǝska gwa, kup na tǝra nǝm gip Kutl cet ropi.)<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Mir erǝm kǝ Yesu ngǝsh wur den ti da'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Den kaar kǝ muntuwo, ar ni Yesu kop gip las kǝ Galili, ama tǝ ndu tǝ kop gip las kǝ mǝn Yahuda da'a, domici mǝn Yahuda kǝ lasi den ngeni wu ri ti eka. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Nan Nyel kǝ dǝmi gip mir bukka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyel kǝ dǝmi gip mir bukka: Zhit ma'ana kǝ kalmayi jeni. 7.2 Livitikus 23.34; Bi Doka kǝ Rop 16.13</char></note> kǝ mǝn Yahuda mbi kosakwo, <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />ar ni mir erǝm kǝ Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ar mbun kǝ za ɗe kǝ te gip atl kǝ Yahuda, kǝ dǝ mir mǝn kulci kar ki shin bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am ju kǝ pi gwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Murgon tu kup ba ndu dǝ mbarǝm mom ti tǝra hoyiwo, tǝ pi bar muri da'a. Tun nan kǝ pi bar juwo, ar mbun kǝ gode mbarǝm bar ju kǝ pi gwa dǝ mom ki ra.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Rawo, ko mir mǝn gǝpi gǝs ma wu ngǝsh wur den ti wi da'a.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Ar ni Yesu wul wur'e,&lt;&lt;Wokoci gǝn kǝ pi untu pi wi da'a, ama kar kǝno ko gonge wokoci ndari in kǝ pi untu. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Kǝno, mbarǝm kǝ atl baa nge in da'a, ama ami ni wu nge domici a yari wur den wani bar ni wu pi. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Kǝno rǝni kǝ ba Nyeli. Amo, aa ri wi da'a, domici wokoci gǝn piwi da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Nan tǝ pa'i yari shirǝm tuwo ar ni tǝ sa gǝs gip las kǝ Galili.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Rawo, den kaar kǝ ndaratǝn kǝ mir mǝn gǝpi gǝs kǝ ba Nyeliwo, ar ni ti ma tǝ ndara, ama muri ni tǝ ndara, ba'e den ger kǝ mbarǝm da'a. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Kǝ ba Nyeliwo kiri kǝ mǝn Yahuda den ne ger gǝs na ngeni momi kar mbarǝm na wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Ako ni mbarǝm tu ra?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Gip womti mbarǝmiwo ar ni shirǝm den ti pi ta tlitǝn gip dlom gǝzǝn muri. Jen ba wule, &lt;&lt;Ti ho mbarǝm ni.&gt;&gt; Jen ngapo wu wule, &lt;&lt;O'o, tǝ jili ni mbarǝm ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Ama murgon ra kan mani shirǝm den ti kandatu womti mbarǝmi baa kum gwa da'a den bi bǝrti kǝ kiri kǝ mǝn Yahudayi.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kulci mbarǝm kǝ ba Nyeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Nan te dlom gip muri kǝ pi Nyeliwo, ar ni Yesu te gip dǝbom bom kǝ Yam tǝ nǝm kulci mbarǝme. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Ar dlǝkǝn mǝn Yahudayi kan wu ngen momi wu wule, &lt;&lt;Imni mbarǝm kǝn mom bar naar untuwu? Ar tu ngap tǝ ri kǝ ba kulci da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kulci gǝno kǝ gam gǝn ni da'a. Ar ɗǝl ni kar muntu kan karǝm sur gwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Murgon tu kup pǝn tii pi argon tu Yam ba ndu'o, tii mani momi'e kulci gǝn ɗǝl ni sur kar Yami, ba'e kǝ gam gǝn ni da'a. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Muntu kan ba kulci ni mbarǝm bar kǝ gam gǝso, tǝ pi ni kǝ dǝ tǝ zami gam gǝs nartǝn kar mbarǝme, ama muntu kan ba ndu ni tǝ ɗǝɗa muntu kan kar tiwo, tǝ mbarǝm mǝn dlǝri den shirǝm gǝs ni, kan lar ra gip ti da'a. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Musa ni bi in kulciyi diya? Kup na untu ko nǝm gin gon ra kan ba kop kulciyi gwa da'a. Unun kem kǝ ndu ri gǝn eka rawu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Ar ni womti mbarǝmi wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ki mǝn itǝr ni, woni den ndu'i ri gi ekayi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am nǝm ni katl a pi, kan ar ba dǝmi inka bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝne. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Ama domici Musa yari in'e kǝ pini sǝrtǝne, kup na ti ni tǝ la gǝsi da'a, ga kori gin ni, kup na untu kǝ sǝr nya den pǝt shukutǝni. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Ar dǝm'e kǝ mani sǝri nya den pǝt shukutǝn den bi kopi kulci kǝ Musa. To, ununu ba kem kǝn kǝ pi lo namǝn den warke dli kǝ mbarǝm kup den pǝt shukutǝn we? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Za ni tloyi shirǝm den kandatu kǝ shin bar ra gwa, zam kǝ tlo ni shirǝm den argon tu kan kor ni ar ra gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni'e Almasihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Ar ni mbarǝm kǝ Urshalima jen nǝm ngeni momi wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm tu ni wu ndu ri gǝs eka diya? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Tin kǝn den shirǝm gip mbarǝme, kan ko nǝm wu wul ti'e argon da'a. Ko mǝn bǝni nǝm ni wi den ti ni'e Almasihuyi? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Ama mǝ mom las tu kan mbarǝm tu ɗǝl ɗir gwa, ama wokoci tu ho Almasihu baa ɗiro murgon ra kan baa mani momi las tu kan tii ɗǝl ɗir gwa da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Nan Yesu gip kulci mbarǝm gip dǝbom bom kǝ Yamo, ar ni tǝ tli yar yam tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Aan, kǝ momǝni, kǝ pal kǝ mom las tu a ɗǝl ɗir gwa. Ba'e na iko kǝ gam gǝn ni a sur da'a, ama muntu kan karǝmo mǝn dlǝri den shirǝm gǝs ni, ama kǝno kǝ mom ti da'a <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />ama amo a mom ti domici kar ti ni a ɗǝl suri, kan ti ni tǝ karǝmi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Den muntuwo ar ni wu ndu wu nǝm ti, ama murgon ra kan mani ne am den ti gwa da'a, nan wokoci gǝs piwi dagwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Kup na untu, na womti gip womti mbarǝmi ngǝsh wur den Yesu. Wu wule, &lt;&lt;Almasihu ni cwato ti pini halama bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am ar man kǝ mbarǝm kǝna?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiri kǝ mǝn Yahuda ndu nǝmi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Mǝn Pariseyi kum mbarǝm den shirǝm shep shep den Yesu gip dlom gǝzǝno, ar ni kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam na mǝn Pariseyi kar mǝn ɓuti bom kǝ Yam den wu ri nǝm ti ɗiri.<verse eid="JHN 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Wokoci kǝ dǝmi gǝn nan kǝn sawi njem, kan a nde ndaratǝn kar muntu kan karǝm gwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Kii ngenǝm, ama kii zamǝn da'a, kan las tu aa riyiwo, kii mani ritǝn da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Ar ni mǝn Yahudayi wul ezǝn'e, &lt;&lt;A ko ni mbarǝm kǝn ba ndu ritǝn kan mii mani zami gǝs da gwawu? Tii ndara ni kar mbarǝm gǝmi kan gǝzǝnka gip mǝn Hellas tǝ kulci wur na? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Ununu mbarǝm tu ba pi nupi nan tǝ wule, &lt;Kii ngenǝmi, ama kii mani zami gǝn da'a?&gt; Kan unun tǝ pa yari na wultǝn'e, &lt;Las tu aa riyiwo, kii mani ritǝn da'ayi?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wule tii bi mal mǝn bi ge mbatli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Den pǝt kǝ pa'i Nyeliwo, muntu kan ar ni'e bar pǝt kǝ domtǝni gwa, ar ni Yesu tlyam dlor kan tǝ tli yar yam tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Murgon tu kup ba kum guzum malo, naa tǝ ɗir karǝm tǝ tla. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Murgon tu kup ngǝsh ti demǝno, mir ɓula mal mǝn bi ge mbatl baa ɗǝl tor gip mbatl gǝzǝni, kandatu Shirǝm kǝ Yam yari gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Ama Ruhu kǝ Yam ni tǝ den shirǝm dene, muntu kan munju ngǝsh wur den ti ba ri kǝ nǝmi gwa, domici wokociwo tare pi Ruhu kǝ Yam wi da'a nan Yesu to gip ɗǝɗatǝn gǝs wi da gwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bi nde mbarǝm nǝm den bi kopi Yesu da'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Na kumi muntuwo ar ni jen gip mbarǝmi wule, &lt;&lt;Na ho bi, mbarǝm tuwo mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam tu kan ba ɗir gwa ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Jen wule, &lt;&lt;Ti ni'e Almasihu.&gt;&gt; Ar ni jen ngapo wu nge wu wule, &lt;&lt;Imnu Almasihu baa cwat tor Galili we? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Shirǝm kǝ Yam yari ni'e Almasihu baa ɗǝl ni gip gǝsgal kǝ Dauda diya? Kan gip Baitalami bǝn tu kan gǝr Dauda gwa ni tii ɗir diya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Rawo, ar ni gam kǝ mbarǝm tatlka den Yesu, jen gip womti mbarǝmi kop kaar kǝ shirǝm kǝ Yesu, jen ngapo wu pi mǝgǝn shirǝm den ti. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Jen ndu wu nǝm ti, ama murgon ra kan mani ne am den ti gwa da'a.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝn cina kǝ mǝn Yahuda hol ngǝshtǝn den Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Kǝ pa'i bisiwo, nan ga mǝn ɓuti bom kǝ Yam pal rin kawo, ar ni ga kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam na mǝn Pariseyi wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kem kǝ ɗir nan ti dawu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Ar ni ga mǝn ɓuti bom kǝ Yami bali wur wu wule, &lt;&lt;Murgon ra kan taɓe shirǝm kandatu mbarǝm tu shirǝm gwa da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Ar ni men Pariseyi wule, &lt;&lt;Anyi! Kǝn ma tǝ jili in kawa? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Kǝ shin ni ko nǝm gip kǝ cina ko gip mǝn Parise kan ngǝsh den ti gwaya? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Ama me gam kǝ mǝn tli mbarǝm mbatl tu kan mom argon den kulci kǝ Musa da'awo, mbarǝm ni kan bi nǝm wur wi gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Ama Nikodimu, muntu kan far ri kar Yesu gwa ra nǝm gip wuri, ar ni tǝ wul wur'e, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />&lt;&lt;Kulci gǝmi wul ni'e dǝ hukunte murgon bat na kumi kǝ bi kǝ mbarǝmi kakani zam dǝ mbarǝm mom argon tu tǝ pi gwa da'aya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Ar ni wu bali ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ki ma mǝn Galili na? Zhit gip shirǝm kǝ Yam kǝ shini, kii zam'e mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam gon baa tli gip Galili da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Kano ko gonge gǝzǝn ba ndara bomi.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Nagǝr tu kan nǝm ti den muri na moni kaari gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Ar ni Yesu to gǝs den Tlǝndǝr mǝn kin Zaitun. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Bar tlo kǝ bi cigǝniwo, kan tǝ pa te gip dǝbom bom kǝ Yami, ar ni mbarǝm kup dom wur kar ti, kan tǝ dǝm atl tǝ kulci wuri. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Ar ni mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa na mǝn Parise ɗiri ti nagǝr gon kan nǝm ti den muri na moni kaari gwa. Wu kem tǝ dlǝr cina dǝ mbarǝme <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />kan wu wul Yesu'e, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, nagǝr kǝno nǝm tǝni den muri na moni kaari. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Gip kulci kǝ Musawo tǝ bi mi bi den mǝ ri badǝr mbarǝm ju eka tǝp kǝ ba la'i gǝzǝn na tate. Kiwo unun kǝ wul rawu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Wu ngen ni kumi kǝ bi gǝs kǝ dǝ wu zam wu nǝm ti gip shirǝm wu ri ti cina ra. Ama Yesu ngus atl kan tǝ pi ta rǝshi argon den atl na yasa gǝsi. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Nan wu ci cina na ngeni momi kar tiwo, ar ni tǝ tlyam dlor kan tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Naa dǝ muntu kan taɓe pi warwat pitǝn da'a gip kǝn pare la'i gǝs na tate.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Kan Yesu ba pa ngus atl es tǝ ci cina na rǝshi argon den atli.<verse eid="JHN 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Nan wu kum untuwo ar ni wu nǝm ndaratǝni, argon tu pǝn den bari gǝzǝn ba ri den heli gip wuri, ba za Yesu nan gǝs na nagǝr mǝri dlor cina da ti. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Ar ni Yesu tlyam dlor kan tǝ wul nagǝr mǝri'e, &lt;&lt;Nagǝr mbarǝme, ako ni mǝn ɗiri gi cinayi rawe? Murgon ra kan hukunte'i gwa diya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Kan nagǝr mbarǝmi ba nǝmi tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝn nartǝni, ko nǝm.&gt;&gt; Ar ni Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ami ma aa hukunte'i da'a, kǝkǝno ndara ama ba kǝ pa pi warwat pitǝn da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni'e cirtǝn kǝ atl kundǝrǝndlip</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Nan Yesu pa shirǝm na mbarǝmo, ar ni tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ami ni'e cirtǝn kǝ mbarǝm gip atl kundǝrǝndlip. Murgon tu kup kopǝno tii dǝm gip dǝmǝn da'a ama tii zam cirtǝn kǝ ge mbatli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Mǝn Pariseyi ba wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ki den bi seda den gam gi, seda giwo untun ar ra da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ko ami ni a bi seda den gam gǝno, seda gǝno kor ni ar ra, domici a mom las tu kan a ɗǝl sur na las tu kan a ri gwa. Ama kǝno, kǝ mom las tu kan a ɗǝl ɗiri ko las tu kan a ri gwa da'a. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Kǝ tlo ni shirǝm den argon tu mbarǝm ba shin gwa, ama amo aa tloyi murgon shirǝm da'a. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Ama ami ni aa tlo shirǝm den baro, tloyi shirǝm gǝno kor ni ar ra, domici ami nangǝn ni da'a. Ban kan karǝm sur gwa ra namǝni. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Ar ra na rǝshi gip kulci gin'e, mbarǝm rop ni bi seda den bar nǝmo, seda gǝzǝno ar ndǝr kǝ dǝ nǝmi. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Ar tu a bi seda den gam gǝn wi, Ban muntu kan karǝm sur gwa ni'e mǝn bi seda gǝn kǝ ropi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Ar ni wu ngen momi kar ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ako ni beyi ra?&gt;&gt; Kan Yesu ba bali wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝ momǝn ko Ban da'a. O kǝ momǝn faro, kii mom Ban pa'e.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Tǝ yari ni shirǝm ju nan tǝ den kulci mbarǝm gip dǝbom bom kǝ Yam kosak na las tu ba ne wurpi kan ba bi gwa. Ama murgon mani nǝmi gǝs da'a nan wokoci gǝs piwu dagwa.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Las tu a riwo, kii mani ritǝn da'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yesu pa wul wur ra'e, &lt;&lt;A ri kǝ ndaratǝni, kii ngenǝmi, kii mǝsh gip warwat pitǝn gi ni. Las tu a riwo, kii mani ritǝn da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Muntu kem mǝn Yahudayi ngen momi wu wule, &lt;&lt;Tǝ rǝni kǝ ri gam gǝs ekaya? Nan tǝ wule, &lt;Las tu a riwo, kii mani ritǝn da'a gwa&gt;?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Ama Yesu ci cina na shirǝm tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝno, kǝ atl ni, ami ngapo a ɗǝl ni sur yami. Kǝno kǝ den kaar atl kǝn ni, ami ngapo kǝ den kaar atl kǝn ni da'a. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Ar ni kem a yari in den kii mǝsh gip warwat pitǝn gi ni, kǝn ni kǝ ngǝsh kǝn den ami'e muntu kan a yari in'e Amiyi ni'e ti dawo, na ho bi, kii mǝsh gip warwat pitǝn gi ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Ar ni mǝn Yahudayi ngen momi kar ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ki ni'e wowe?&gt;&gt; Yesu bali wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Amiyi ni'e muntu kan a pare yari in gwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Ami ra na bar na womti kǝ yari kǝ hukunte gini. Ama ti muntu kan karǝmo ge shirǝm ni tǝ yari, ami ngapo argon tu a kum kar ti gwa ni a yari mbarǝme.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Wu mani momi'e den Bas ni tǝ shirǝm da'a. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Ar ni Yesu wule, &lt;&lt;Wokoci tu kǝ tli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gip bi kǝ mǝn Hellaso &lt;&lt;tli Nya Mbarǝm yamo,&gt;&gt; ar ni'e ɗǝɗatǝne.</char></note> Nya Mbarǝm yamo, ar ni kii mom den Ami ni'e ti, kan kii pa mom es'e a pi argon kǝ gam gǝn da'a, ama a yari ni argon tu Ban kulcim gwa katl. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Muntu kan karǝm gwa ra namǝni. Tǝ za'ǝm nangǝn da'a, domici ko gigasi a pi ni argon tu kan tǝ ndu gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Nan tǝ den yari shirǝm juwo ar ni mbarǝm na womti ngǝsh wur den ti.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ho zami gami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Yesu wul mǝn Yahuda ju kan ngǝsh wur den ti gwa'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝn ni kǝ dǝm dlakǝt na kulci gǝno, na ho bi, kǝn ni'e ho mǝn kopi gǝni. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Ar ni kii mom ge shirǝmi, ge shirǝmi ngap baa ɗiri in zami gam gi ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Wu nǝmi ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝn gǝsgal kǝ Ibǝrahim ni kan mǝ taɓe dǝmi zher kǝ murgon da'a. Imni ki wule mii zam gam gǝmi rawu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu bali wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Na ho bi ni a yari ine, murgon tu kup ba pi warwat pitǝno, zher kǝ warwat pitǝn ni. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Zher baa pi ta dǝmi gip bom ko gigasi da'a, ama nyawo, kǝ bomi ni ko gigasi. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Ra untuwo, Nyayi ni bi in zami gam gino, na ho bi, ar dǝm'e kǝ zam gam gin ituwi. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />A mom'e kǝn gǝsgal kǝ Ibǝrahim ni. Kup na untu kǝn den ndu'i kǝ rim eka, domici kǝ nge nǝmi kulci gǝn ka. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />A yari in ni argon tu a shin kar Ban gwa, kǝn ma argon tu kǝ kum kar ba gin gwa ni kǝ pi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shetan ni'e ba gi ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Wu nǝmi ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ba gǝmi ni'e Ibǝrahim.&gt;&gt; Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝn mimir kǝ Ibǝrahim ni fawo, na kii pi bar ju Ibǝrahim pi gwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Ami mbarǝm ni kan yari in ge shirǝm tu a kum kar Yam gwa, ama kǝn den ndu'i'e kǝ rim eka. Ibǝrahim pi bar unju da'a. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Ra untuwo kǝn ni den pi bar ju kan ba gin ba pi gwa.&gt;&gt; Ar ni wu bali ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝn gǝri kǝ kaari ni da'a, Ba gǝmi nǝm ni, ti ni'e Yam na gam gǝsi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Kan Yesu ba wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Dǝ wule Yam ni'e Ba gino, na kǝ ndu'ǝm wi, domici kar Yam ni a ɗǝl suri, kan kǝkǝno amin kǝn ɗe. Ami ni ra ɗe kǝ gam gǝn da'a, ama Yam ni karǝmi. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Unun kem kǝ mom argon tu a yari gwa da'awe? Domici kǝ nge kumi kulci gǝn ka ni. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Kǝn kǝ ba gin Shetan gun dun itǝr ni, kan kǝn den ndu'i kǝ pi argon tu ba gin ba ndu gwa. Tǝ mǝn ri mbarǝm eka ni na ne gǝs kǝ pi bari. Tǝ mani nǝmi ge shirǝm da'a, domici ge shirǝm ra gip ti da'a. Wokoci tu kup tǝ cen laro, gǝs lǝka gǝs ni tǝ yari, domici ti mǝn ceni lar ni, basi lar esi. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Ama nan ge shirǝm ni a yariwo, ar ni kǝ nge ngǝshtǝn demǝnka. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Gon ra gip kǝn kan baa bi seda den'e a taɓe pi warwat pitǝna? Ge shirǝm ni pa a yariwo, unun kem kǝ nge ngǝshtǝn demǝn kawu? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Muntu kup kan kǝ Yamno tǝ kum argon tu kan Yam ba yari gwa. Ama kǝno, kǝ kum argon tu Yam ba yari gwa da'a nan kǝn kǝ Yam ni da gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu man Ibǝrahim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Mǝn Yahudayi nǝmi ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Dlat ni mǝ yari da'aya den ki ba mǝn Samariya ni, kan ki ra na itǝr gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ami ra na itǝr gipǝn da'a, ama a bi ni nartǝn Ban, kǝn ngapo, kǝ bim nartǝn da'a. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />A ngeni ni gam gǝn ɗǝɗatǝn da'a, ama gon ra kan ba ngenim gwa, kan tǝ ni'e mǝn tloyi mbarǝm shirǝmi. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Na ho bi ni a yari in den'e kup muntu kan ba kop shirǝm gǝno, ko njem tii mǝshka da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Den muntuwo ar ni mǝn Yahudayi wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝkǝno mǝ mom wi den ki mǝn itǝr ni! Ibǝrahim mǝshka, untu ni es ga mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yami, ama kǝ wule muntu kop kulci giwo, ko njem tii mǝshka da'a. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Gip shini giwo kǝ man ni ba gǝmi Ibǝrahima? Tǝ mǝshka, untu ni ma ga mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yami. Kǝ kum wule ki woni we?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu bali wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ami ni a ɗǝɗa gam gǝno, ɗǝɗa gam gǝniwo argon ni da'a. Ban ni, muntu kan kǝ wule Yam gin ni gwa, ti ni'e mǝn ɗǝɗa gǝni. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Kup na kǝ mom ti da'a, ama amo, a mom ti. Ami ni a wule a mom ti dawo, a dǝm mǝn ceni lar wi wule kǝne, ama a mom ti, kan ti ni a kop shirǝm gǝsi. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Ba gin Ibǝrahim pi ghol mbatl kǝ tǝ zam shini zhan gǝni, tǝ shini kan tǝ pi ghol mbatli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Mǝn Yahudayi wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ ri sheti ghon hauya rop na kutl na gǝriwi da'a, ama kǝ wule kǝ shin Ibǝrahima?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Na ho bi ni a yari ine, kapǝn dǝ gǝr Ibǝrahimo Ami ra.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Den muntuwo ar ni wu yem tat kǝ la'i gǝsi. Ama Yesu ghun gǝsi, kan tǝ ɗǝl tǝ za gip bom kǝ Yamika.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ɓul ger kǝ mbarǝm gon kan gǝr ti tabi gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Nan Yesu ci cinawo, ar ni tǝ shin mbarǝm gon tabi tun gǝri gǝsi. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Mir mǝn kulci kar ti ngen momi kar ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, warwat pitǝn kǝ wo ni kem kan ba gǝr mbarǝm tu tabiyi, gwas na, ko kǝ ga mǝn gǝri gǝs ni?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Ar ni Yesu wule, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm tu ko mǝn gǝri gǝs ni pi warwat pitǝn da'a, ama muntu pini kǝ dǝ mbarǝm shin mbap ju kan Yam ni nangǝs ba pi gwa den ti. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Ar nǝm mi te yarka mǝ ci cina na pi mbap kǝ muntu kan karǝm gwa kǝ pǝte. Gas den ɗirtǝne, nan mbarǝm baa mani pi mbap da gwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Ami ni ra den kaar atlo, ami ni'e cirtǝn kǝ atl kundǝrǝndlip.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Nan ti yari untuwo, ar ni tǝ bǝse mo'ǝm den atli, tǝ liiti, kan tǝ zaapi den ger kǝ mbarǝmi. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Ar ni tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Mbǝri, ri ho gerka gip mal kǝ Silowam&gt;&gt; (Kartǝn ituwi). Ar ni mbarǝmi ndara kan tǝ ho gerka, kan tǝ pal na mani shini bar gǝsi.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Ga berǝm dǝmi gǝs na munju ba kur shin ti den liri bar ngen momi wu wule, &lt;&lt;Muntu ni'e mbarǝm tu kan ba kur dǝm kǝ liri bar gwa diya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Jen wule &lt;&lt;Ti ni.&gt;&gt; Nami ngapo wu wule, &lt;&lt;O'o, tǝ pini kama nan ti.&gt;&gt; Ama mbarǝmi na gam gǝs wule, &lt;&lt;Ami ni'e mbarǝmi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Wu ngen momi na wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Imni pi kan ger gi ba ɓul rawu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Ar ni tǝ bali wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm tu ba la ti bi Yesu gwa ni liiti gurku na mo'ǝm gǝs kan tǝ zaapi den ger gǝni. Tǝ wulǝm'e a su Silowam a ho gerka. Ar ni a ndara kan a ho gerka, kan a nǝm shini bari.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Wu ngen momi kar ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ako ni mbarǝmi ra?&gt;&gt; Ar ni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;A mom da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝn Pariseyi kop gǝs kǝ mani shini bar kǝ tabiyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Ar ni ga mbarǝmi ndara na mbarǝmi kan far tabi ni gwa kar mǝn Parise. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Den pǝt Asabar, pǝt shukutǝn ni Yesu liiti gurku kan tǝ ɓul ger kǝ mbarǝmi. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Ar ni mǝn Pariseyi pa ngen momi kar ti den kandatu pi kan mani shini bar gǝs ba pal gwa. Ar ni tǝ bali wur'e, &lt;&lt;Tǝ zaapi ni gurku den ger gǝni, kan a ho gerka, ar tu kǝkǝno a shin bar wi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Jen gip mǝn Pariseyi wule, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm tu kan pi muntuwo kar Yam ni tǝ ɗǝl da'a, domici tǝ nge kop doka kǝ ba dǝ pi mbap den pǝt shukutǝn da'a.&gt;&gt; Ama nami wule, &lt;&lt;Imni mǝn warwat pitǝn baa mani pi halama bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am untuwu?&gt;&gt; Ar ni wu zam tatli gam den shirǝmiyi.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Ar ni wu pa bal wur kar muntu far tabiyi gwa wu ngen momi kar ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Unun kii yari den mbarǝmi? Ki ni tǝ ɓul ger gi.&gt;&gt; Mbarǝmi bali wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ti mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Kup na untu mǝn Yahudayi nǝm den'e gǝr tǝni tabiyi kan kǝkǝno tǝ zam shini bar da'a, ar ni wu kar bar den ga mǝn gǝri kǝ mbarǝmi. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Kan wu ngen momi kar wur wu wule, &lt;&lt;Muntuwo nya gin na? Kǝ wule gǝr tǝni tabiyi? Imni pi kǝkǝno tǝ mani shini bar rawu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Ar ni ga mǝn gǝri gǝs nǝmi wur wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝ mom'e nya gǝmi ni, kan mǝ mom'e mǝ gǝr tǝni tabiyi. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Ama imni pi kǝkǝno tǝ shin bari ko muntu ɓul ger gǝso, mǝ mom da'a. Ngen ni momi kar ti. Tǝ kǝm las kǝ mbarǝm wi, tii yari in na gam gǝsi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Ga mǝn gǝri gǝs yari ni untu den kumi bǝrti kǝ mǝn Yahuda, domici mǝn Yahudayi tare ne bi dene wi den'e kup murgon tu kan wule tǝ ngǝsh ti den Yesu ni'e Almasihuwo baa ɗǝli tǝka gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Ar ni kem ga mǝn gǝri gǝs wule, &lt;&lt;Tǝ kǝm las kǝ mbarǝm wi, ngen ni momi kar ti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Ar ni mǝn Pariseyi pa la bi mbarǝmi kan far tabi gwa, wu ngen momi kar ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Yari mi argon tu kan pi gwa kǝ bi Yam nartǝni. Mǝ mom'e mbarǝm tu kan warke'i tuwo mǝn warwat pitǝn ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Ar ni tǝ bali wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ko mǝn warwat pitǝn ni ma, amo a mom da'a. Bar nǝm ni a momi. Faro gǝrǝm ni tabiyi ama kǝkǝno a shin bar wi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Kan wu pa ngen momi kar ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Unun tǝ pi'iwe? Tǝp imnu tǝ ɓul ger giwu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Tǝ nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A yari in wi ama kǝ nge kumi gǝnka. Unun kem kǝ ndu kǝ kum ra esi? Kǝn ma kǝ ndu ni'e kǝ pal mir mǝn kulci kar ti pa'a?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Ar ni wu yari ti mǝgǝn shirǝm wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ki ni'e nye mǝn kulci kar ti, miwo, mǝn mir mǝn kopi kulci kǝ Musa ni. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Mǝ mom'e Yam shirǝm na Musa, ama mbarǝm tuwo, mǝ mom ako ni tǝ ɗǝl ɗir da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Kan mbarǝmi ba nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Unu fa utu untu! Kǝ mom las tu kan tǝ ɗǝl ɗir gwa da'a, ama ar tu tǝ ɓul ger gǝn wi! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Mǝ mom'e Yam ba kum mǝn warwat pitǝn da'a. Tǝ kum ni mbarǝm tu kan ba bote ti na pi argon tu tǝ ndu gwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Ar tu na la'i gǝs kǝ pi atlo mǝ taɓe kumi den'e ɓul ger kǝ mbarǝm gon kan gǝr ti tabi gwa da'a. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />O na mbarǝm tuwo kar Yam ni tǝ ɗǝl dawo, tii mani pi argon da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Den muntuwo ar ni wu bali ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ki kan gǝr ki gip warwat pitǝn gwa ni kǝkǝno kǝ ri kǝ kulci miya?&gt;&gt; Ar ni wu kar tika.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dǝmi tabi gip ruhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yesu zam na kumi den'e wu kar mbarǝmika. Ar ni nan tǝ zam tiwo, kan tǝ ngen momi kar ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝ ngǝsh ki den Nya Mbarǝma?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Ar ni mbarǝmi ngen momi kar ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝn nartǝni, wo ni'e Nya Mbarǝmiyi? Yarim kǝ dǝ a ngǝshim den ti ra.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Kan Yesu ba nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝ shin ti wi, ti ni den shirǝm nan ki.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Ar ni mbarǝmi wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, a ngǝshim den ti wi,&gt;&gt; kan tǝ ngus cina dǝ Yesu tǝ bote ti.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesu wule, &lt;&lt;A sur ni atl kǝ tloyi shirǝmi, kǝ dǝ munju tabino wu zam shini bari, kan munju kan ba shin baro wu palka tabiyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Nan mǝn Pariseyi jen kan ra kosak nan ti gwa kum untuwo, ar ni wu ngen momi kar ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝn ma tabi ijuwa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Kan Yesu ba bali wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Dǝ wule kǝn tabino, na kii nǝra na warwat pitǝn da'a. Ama kǝkǝn kan kǝ kum den kǝ shin baro, warwat pitǝn gin ra dlakǝt nan kǝne.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Shirǝm den mǝn le tǝm na tǝm gǝsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />&lt;&lt;Ge shirǝm ni a yari in kǝn mǝn Parise, mbarǝm tu kan kop tǝp bǝdlabǝn bin tǝm kan tǝ te gipi da'a, ama tǝ kop tǝp gon tǝ te gipiwo, mur ni na mur mǝn dlǝri den tǝpe. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Muntu kan te gipi tǝp bǝdlabǝn bin tǝmiwo, ti ni'e mǝn le tǝmi. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Mǝn ɓuti bomi baa ɓuli ti bǝdlabǝni. Tǝmi baa kum yar kǝ mǝn le gǝzǝni. Tǝ la bi tǝm gǝs na sun gǝzǝni kan tǝ nde wur cina wu ɗǝl kaari. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Ti ni tǝ ɗǝli wur kup kaariwo, tǝ nde wur ni cina, tǝmi den kopi gǝsi domici wu mom yar gǝsi. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Wii kop mǝn dǝki da'a, se de wu kǝtǝri ti domici wu mom yar kǝ mǝn dǝki da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesu yari wur untu, ama wu mani momi argon tu tǝ yari wur gwa da'a.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni'e ho mǝn le tǝme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Ra untuwo, ar ni Yesu pa yari wur ra'e, &lt;&lt;Na ho bi ni a yari ine, ami ni'e bǝdlabǝn bin tǝmi. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Munju kup kan nda ɗir cina da'ǝmo mur ni na mur mǝn dlǝri den tǝpe, ama tǝmi nge kumi gǝzǝnka. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Ami ni'e bǝdlabǝni, kup muntu kop tǝp karǝmo, tii zam ɗǝltǝne. Tii ɗir te gipi tǝ pal tǝ ɗǝli, tǝ zam yari jir kǝ ci. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Mur ba ɗir ni katl kǝ dǝ tǝ pi mure, tǝ ri eka, tǝ pa liika. Ama a ɗir ni kǝ dǝ wu zam ge mbatl tu kan baa pa da gwa, kan wu zam ti na laa'i.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />&lt;&lt;Ami ni'e ho mǝn le tǝme. Ho mǝn le tǝm ba bi ge mbatl gǝs den bi tǝmi. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Mǝn le tǝm kǝ wurpiwo, tǝmiwo gwas ni da'a. Ra untuwo, ti ni tǝ shin yer lǝp den ɗirtǝno, tii za tǝmika tǝ kǝtǝr gǝs kan dǝ yer lǝpi tli den tǝmi tǝ gǝzan wurka. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Mbarǝmi kǝtǝr ni gǝs domici tǝ mǝn le tǝm kǝ dǝ ɓatl ti ni katl, ko njem argon ghun ti na tǝmi da'a.<verse eid="JHN 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />&lt;&lt;Ami ni'e ho mǝn le tǝme, a mom tǝm gǝni, kan tǝm gǝn momǝni. <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />Kandatu Ban momǝn kan a mom Ban gwa itu, kan ami den bi ge mbatl gǝn den bi tǝmi. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Ami ra na nami tǝmi kan ra gip garke tǝmi mǝnkǝn da gwa. Ar nǝmǝn te yarka wu ma a ɗir wuri. Wu ma wii kum yar gǝni, kan wu dǝm garke nǝm, mǝn le gǝzǝn ma nǝm. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Argon tu kem Ban ba ndu'ǝm gwa ni'e a bi ge mbatl gǝn kǝ dǝ a pa pǝn ar gǝn esi. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Murgon baa mani pǝnim nge mbatl gǝnka da'a, domici ami ni a bi ge mbatl gǝn na gam gǝni. Ami na iko kǝ a bi ge mbatl gǝni, untu ni es ami ra na iko kǝ pali gǝs ra. Argon tu Ban yarǝm kǝ dǝ a pi gwa itu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Den shirǝm tuwo ar ni bi i'nde mǝn Yahudayi nǝm da'a. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Na womti gǝzǝn wule, &lt;&lt;Ti mǝn itǝr ni, ar ni tǝ pi zhe'e pitǝn ra. Unun kem kǝ kum ti rawu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Ama nami wule, &lt;&lt;Shirǝm kǝ mbarǝm mǝn itǝr itu da'a. Mǝn itǝr ba mani ɓuli ger kǝ tabi ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝn Yahuda nge Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Gip wokoci sanyi, kan den pi Nyel kǝ ta'i Yam Bom kǝ Yam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyel Hanukkah ituwi na bi kǝ mǝn Yahuda</char></note> su Urshalimaka. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yesu ngap ra gip bom kǝ Yam den ɓomi asǝm gip las tu ba la ti bi'e Dlabǝn Shukutǝn kǝ Solomon gwa.<verse eid="JHN 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Ar ni mǝn Yahuda dom wur wu gandǝl ti, kan wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Har gigasi ni kii za mi gip dǝmǝn gami? Ki ni'e Almasihu fawo, yari mi tetla tetla.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Kan Yesu ba nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A tare a yari in wi, ama kǝ nge ngǝshtǝnka dene. Mbap ju kan a pi gip sun kǝ Ban gwa ni ba bi seda demǝni. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Ama kǝ ngǝsh kǝn den untu ni da'a, nan kǝn tǝm gǝn ni da gwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Tǝm gǝn ba pi ni argon tu a yari gwa. A mom wuri, kan wu kopǝni. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />A bi wur bi wur ge mbatl tu kan baa pa da gwa wi, kan ko njem wii mǝshka da'a. Murgon ra kan baa mani ɗǝli gǝzǝnka gip am gǝn gwa da'a. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Ban tu kan bim wuro, tǝ naar man kup, murgon ra kan baa mani ɗǝli gǝzǝnka gip am gǝs gwa da'a. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Ami na Banwo, nǝm ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Ar ni mǝn Yahudayi pa yem tat kǝ la'i gǝsi. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Kan Yesu ba wul wur'e,&lt;&lt;A pi mbuni bar na womti tǝp kar Ban. Kǝkǝno den gonge ni gip wur kǝ ri kǝ la'i gin na tatwe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Ar ni mǝn Yahudayi bali ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝ ri kǝ la'i gi na tat den ko nǝm gip mbuni mbap ju kan kǝ pi gwa da'a, ama den mburi Yami, domici ki mbarǝm ni katl, ama kǝ pali gam gika Yami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ar ra na rǝshi gip Kulci gin'e, &lt;A wule kǝn mir yam ni.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zabura 82.6 </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Mǝ mom'e rǝshi Shirǝm kǝ Yam baa cen lar da'a. Babom ni wul munju kan kum shirǝm gǝs gwa &lt;mir yami&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />im nu na ami kan Bǝba ne den ami gwas ni kan tǝ karǝm sur atl gwawu? Unun ɗiri shirǝm den'e a mbur Yam nan a wule, &lt;Ami Nya Yam ni gwa?&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Ba kǝ ngǝsh kǝn ni demǝn da'a, mbap ju Ban den pi gwa ni fa a pi da gwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Ama ar ni a pi fawo, kup na kǝ ngǝsh kǝn demǝn dawo, ngǝsh kǝn ni den mbap ju, kǝ dǝ kǝ mom ni, kan kǝ ngǝsh kǝn den'e Bǝba ra gipi ni, kan ami ra gip Bǝbayi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Ar ni wu pa ndu wu nǝm ti, ama tǝ ɗǝli wur amka.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Kan Yesu ba pa jikat ɓula kǝ Urdun tǝ mbubar las tu kan Yohana den pi batisma na pare bar gwa, tǝ dǝm gǝs barta. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Ar ni mbarǝm na womti ɗir kar ti. Wu wule, &lt;&lt;Rawo Yohana pi halama bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am gon da'a, ama argon tu kup tǝ yari den mbarǝm tuwo, untu ni ar ra.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Kan mbarǝm na womti kan ra lasi gwa ba ngǝsh wur den Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Mǝshtǝn kǝ Li'azaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Mbarǝm gon mǝn sun Li'azaru ra den kumi dli. Ti mbarǝm kǝ Betanya ni, nye bǝn kǝ ga Maryamu na erǝm gǝs Marta. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Maryamu tu, muntu erǝm gǝs Li'azaru ra ɓom atl den kumi dliwo, nǝm ti ni'e muntu kan shoti mir den kaar asǝm kǝ Babom kan tǝ sarka na ta gam gǝs gwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Ar ni ga erǝm gǝs mir mǝtliyi kar bar den Yesu wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Babomi, muntu kan kǝ ndu gwa ra den kumi dli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Nan tǝ kum untuwo, ar ni Yesu wule, &lt;&lt;Kumi dli gǝs tu baa ri ga mǝshtǝn da'a. O'o, den bi ɗǝɗa Yam ni, kǝ dǝ Nya Yam zam ɗǝɗatǝn tǝp kar untuyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yesu ba ndu Marta na ga erǝm gǝs Maryamu na Li'azaru. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Kup na untu, nan tǝ kum'e Li'azaru ra den kumi dliwo, ar ni tǝ dǝm gǝs las tu tǝra gwa kǝ muri rop ra.<verse eid="JHN 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Kan tǝ wul mir mǝn kulci kar ti'e, &lt;&lt;Mǝ pa pal ni gip atl kǝ Yahuda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, ar dlyam wi da'a kan mǝn Yahuda ndu wu la ki na tat gwa, kup na untuwo kǝ ndu kǝ pa pal bartaya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Awa kutl cet rop ni gip nde pǝt nǝm diya? Mbarǝm tu kup ba ɓom asǝm gip pǝto, tii pat asǝmka da'a, domici tǝ shin bar na cirtǝn kǝ den atl kǝni. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Ama muntu kup ba ɓom asǝm gip gas gwa ni ba pat asǝme, nan cirtǝn ra kar ti dagwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Nan tǝ yari muntuwo, ar ni tǝ ci cina tǝ yari wur'e, &lt;&lt;Berǝm gǝmi Li'azaru nde umur kawi, ama aa ri putu tika.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Mir mǝn kulci kar ti bali ti'e, &lt;&lt;Babomi, umur ni fa tǝ ndewo, tii kum tǝmi kǝ dli gǝsi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Yesu ni den shirǝm den'e Li'azaru mǝsh kawi, ama mir mǝn kulci kar ti pǝn'e nde umur kǝ shukutǝn ni ti dene.<verse eid="JHN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Ar ni tǝ yari wur ghon tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Li'azaru mǝsh kawi. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Ar gholim mbatl domici gin nan ami ra lasi da gwa, kǝ dǝ kǝ ngǝsh kǝn den Yam ra. Ama mǝ rǝni kar ti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Ar ni Toma (kan ba la ti bi'e nye Ngumci<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Didimus (na bi kǝ mǝn Hellas) kup rop ju ba pi nupi'e ngumci</char></note> gwa) wul nami mir mǝn kulci kar Yesuyi'e &lt;&lt;Mǝn ma mǝ su nǝka, kǝ dǝ mǝ mǝsh ni nan ti pa'e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni'e tlitǝn gip mǝshi mbarǝme na ge mbatli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Nan Yesu mbubaro, ar ni tǝ zam na momi den Li'azaru pi muri wupse na kapi wi. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Betanyawo kosak na Urshalima ni ar ra, bar kǝ mil rop<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bar kǝ kilomita myakan ituwi.</char></note>, <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Mǝn Yahuda na womti ɗir wi kǝ kulu keti na ga Marta na Maryamu den mǝshtǝn kǝ erǝm gǝzǝni. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Nan Marta kum'e Yesu den ɗirtǝno, ar ni tǝ ɗǝl tǝ ri kǝ mbori gǝsi, ama Maryamu dǝm gǝs bomi.<verse eid="JHN 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Marta wul Yesu'e, &lt;&lt;Babomi, kira far ɗewo, erǝm gǝn ba ri kǝ mǝshtǝn da'a. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Ama a mom'e kǝkǝn ma Yam baa bi'i argon tu kup kǝ liri gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Erǝm gi baa tli ra esi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Marta nǝmi ti'e, &lt;&lt;A mom'e ti tli ra es gas pa'i bar kup kan mǝshi mbarǝm baa tli ra na ge mbatl gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ami ni'e tlitǝn kǝ mǝshi mbarǝm kan ami ni'e ge mbatli. Muntu kan ngǝsh ti demǝno, tii dǝm na ra na ge mbatli, ko ma tǝ mǝsh nika. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />Muntu kan ra na ge mbatli kan ngǝsh ti demǝno, tii mǝsh da'a. Kǝ ngǝsh ki den muntu ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Marta wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Aan, Babomi, a nǝm wi den ki ni'e Almasihu, Nya Yami, muntu kan ba sur gip atl gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Nan tǝ pa'i yari muntuwo ar ni tǝ pal rin bomka kan tǝ la bi erǝm gǝs Maryamu markǝm tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci mbirawi, tǝ den ngeni gi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Nan Maryamu kum muntuwo, ar ni tǝ tlyam na zhotǝn tǝ ri kar ti. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Ar dǝm'e Yesu mbubar gip bǝni wi da'a, ama tǝ'i las tu Marta mo nan ti gwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Nan mǝn Yahuda kan ra na Maryamu gip bom den damtǝn nan ti shin tǝ tlyam na zhotǝn kan tǝ ɗǝlo ar ni wu pǝn den'e tǝ rǝni kǝ ba gambǝci'i kǝ kulu lasi.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Nan Maryamu mbubar las tu Yesu ra, nan tǝ shin tiwo, ar ni tǝ nda atl cina da ti tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Babomi, na dǝ wule ki ra far ɗewo, erǝm gǝn baa mǝshka da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Nan Yesu shin ti den kulu, na mǝn Yahuda ju kan ɗir nan ti ma den kuluwo, ar ghun ti gip ruhu kan tǝ dam ti hoyi gip mbatl gǝsi. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Ar ni tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ako ni kǝ kap tiwe?&gt;&gt; Kan wu bali ti'e, &lt;&lt;Babomi, ɗir shini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Ar ni Yesu kuli.<verse eid="JHN 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Ar ni mǝn Yahudayi wule, &lt;&lt;Shin kandatu tǝ ndu ti gwa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Ama jen gip wur wule, &lt;&lt;Muntu kan ɓul ger kǝ batabi tu baa mani hane mbarǝm tu mǝshtǝn diya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu tli Li'azaru gip mǝshi mbarǝme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Nan Yesu ra gip damtǝn den mǝshtǝniwo, ar ni tǝ ri kar gambǝci'i. Gambǝci'iwo shu ni kan bor gip tat gwa kan ba le bisika na tat goni. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Jirkǝt ni tatika markǝme.&gt;&gt; Ama Marta, erǝm kǝ mǝshiyi wule, &lt;&lt;Ama Babomi, kǝkǝno usuntǝn ni katl bani, domici muri gǝs wupse ituwi na mǝshtǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Ar ni Yesu wule, &lt;&lt;A yari'i ni da'aya? E den ki ni kǝ la Yam mbatlo, kii shin ɗǝɗatǝn kǝ Yami?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Ar ni wu kutǝl tatika markǝme. Yesu tli ger yami, kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Bǝba, a goode'i den kǝ kumǝni. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />A mom'e kǝ kumǝn ko gigasi, ama a yari ni untu den bi kǝ munju kan dlor ɗegwa, kǝ dǝ wu nǝm den'e ki ni kǝ karǝmi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Nan tǝ yari muntuwo, ar ni Yesu tli yar yam tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Li'azaru, ɗǝl tori!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Ar ni mǝshi mbarǝmi ɗǝl tor, am gǝs na asǝm gǝs na ɓali na tutul ghumi mǝshi mbarǝme, na ba ger gǝs ɓali na tutule. Yesu wul wur'e,&lt;&lt;Pǝtl ni tutul ghumi mǝshi mbarǝm tuka kǝ za tǝni tǝ ndara.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gudlumi kǝ ri Yesu eka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Ra untuwo, ar ni na womti kǝ mǝn Yahuda kan ɗir kǝ shirmi Maryamu shin argon tu Yesu pi gwa, kan wu ngǝsh wur den ti. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Ama jen gǝzǝn ri kar mǝn Parise kan wu yari wur argon tu Yesu pi gwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Ar ni kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam na mǝn Pariseyi la bi domtǝn kǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝm kǝ mǝn Isra'ila. Wu ngen momi wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ununu mii pi den muntu we? Ar tu mbarǝm tu den ta pi halama bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am na womti. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Mǝn ni mǝ za ti tǝ ci cina na untuwo, mbarǝm kup ba ngǝsh wur den ti, kan dǝ mǝn Roma ɗir nǝm atl gǝmika na Bom kǝ Yam gǝmi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Ar ni nǝm gip wur mǝn sun Kayafas, bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam kǝ sheti ghoni, shirǝm tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ko nǝm kǝ mom argon da'a! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Kǝ mom ni'e ar mani dǝ mbarǝm nǝm mǝshka na dǝ mbarǝm kǝ atl kup liika gwa da'a ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Tǝ yari ni untu gip bopya kǝ gam gǝs da'a, ama nan ti ni'e bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam kǝ sheti ghon tawo, tǝ yari ni ge shirǝm kan ɗǝl sur kar Yam gwa den Yesu baa mǝsh den am kǝ atl kǝ mǝn Yahuda kup, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />ba'e den am kǝ atl kǝ mǝn Yahuda ni katl da'a ama kǝ dǝ tǝ dom mimir kǝ Yam kan gǝzan ko ako gwa wu dǝm nǝm. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Argon tu kan pǝn den gas tawo ar ni wu pi ta ngeni tǝp kǝ ri Yesu eka.<verse eid="JHN 11:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Ra untuwo ar ni Yesu i'ci cina na ɗǝltǝn gip mbarǝm kǝ mǝn Yahuda gip pili da'a, ar ni tǝ za lasika tǝ ndara atl kan kosak na bi lǝpe, gip bǝn tu kan ba la ti bi'e Ifraimu gwa, lasi ni tǝ dǝm na mir mǝn kulci kar ti.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Nan ar mbi kosak na Nyel Jikat Bǝdlabǝn kǝ mǝn Yahudawo, ar ni mbarǝm na womti za mir heli bǝn wu to Urshalima kǝ pi bar ju ba pi kǝ pali mbarǝm dlǝran cina dǝ Yam gwa kapǝn Nyeli. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Wu pi ta ngeni Yesu, wu ra dlor gip bom kǝ Yam wu den ngeni momi kar ezǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kǝ shinwe? Tii ɗir ni kǝ ba Nyeli diya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Rawo kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam na mǝn Pariseyi bi biwi den murgon tu kup zam na momi las tu Yesu rawo, tǝ ɗir yari kǝ dǝ wu nǝm ti.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Bǝrke Yesu mir gip Betanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Muri mukka kapǝn Nyel Jikat Bǝdlabǝniwo, ar ni Yesu mbubar gip Betanya, las tu Li'azaru, muntu Yesu tli ti gip mǝshi mbarǝmi ba dǝm gwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Kan ba pi Yesu bar kǝ ci kǝ gas lasi. Marta bi wur fingali, Li'azaru ngapo tǝra gip munju dǝm kǝ ci fingal na Yesu gwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Ar ni Maryamu pǝn tulare kǝ nardi, mǝn wurpi na naari, tǝ shoti den kaar asǝm kǝ Yesu kan tǝ sari ti asǝmka na ta gam gǝsi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bǝrke Yesu tulare bisi rop. Tulare bar kǝ rabi lita ni Maryamu gip Betani shoti ti (Matta 26.7; Markus 14.3), kan nǝmi ngapo gip kǝti atl kǝ Galili ni nagǝr gon pi (Luka 7.37,38). </char></note> Ar ni bomi kup nga lasi na tǝmi kasǝri.<verse eid="JHN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Ama Yahuda Iskariyoti, nǝm gip mir mǝn kulci kar ti, muntu kan ba ri kǝ bi Yesu kagwa nge na wultǝn'e, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />&lt;&lt;Unun kem baa wur mir tuka den wurpi nan baa kǝm ɓatli mǝn mbap kǝ sheti ghon nǝm gwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gip bi kǝ mǝn Hellaso dinari hauya kutl cet nantam (300).</char></note> dǝ bi wurpiyi munju am ri wur kaar da gwawu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Tǝ yari ni untu ba'e den argon tu ba ndo na munju am ri wur kaar da'a ba ghun tǝni da'a, ama domici ti mur ni, ti ni'e mǝn ne posh wurpi gǝzǝni, kan tǝ kur yem gip wurpiyi tǝ pi bar kǝ gam gǝs nari.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Yesu bali wur'e, &lt;&lt;Za tǝni, tǝ ne ni mir tuka ra den bi pǝt kapi gǝni. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Kii nǝra na munju am ri wur kaar dagwa nan kǝn ko gigasi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bi doka kǝ rop 15.11</char></note> ama kii nǝra namǝn ko gigasi da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Nan womti mbarǝm kǝ mǝn Yahuda mom ka'e Yesu ra bartawo kan wu ri, ba'e kǝ dǝ wu shin ti ni katl da'a ama wu pa shin Li'azaru, muntu Yesu tli ti gip mǝshi mbarǝm gwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Ar ni kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa gudlumi kǝ dǝ wu ri Li'azaru eka esi, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />den'e domici gǝso mǝn Yahuda na womti den za'i gǝzǝnka wu den ritǝn gǝzǝn kar Yesu wu den ngǝshtǝn den ti.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɗǝɗa Yesu nan tǝ te gip bǝn Urshalima gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Bar tlowo, ar ni womti mbarǝmi kan ɗir kǝ Nyel Jikat Bǝdlabǝni ba kum'e Yesu ra den tǝp gǝs kǝ tetǝn gip bǝn Urshalima. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Ar ni wu yem am kin dabino kan wu ɗǝl kǝ metǝn nan ti wu den tli yar na wultǝn'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">&lt;&lt;Hosana!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gip bi kǝ mǝn Yahudawo ar ba nupi'e (Ɗǝltǝne) ama muntu palka shirǝm kǝ ɗǝɗatǝne (Zabura 118.25,26).</char></note> Mǝn albarka ni'e muntu kan ba ɗir gip sun kǝ Babom gwa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">Mǝn albarka ni'e gun kǝ Isra'ila!&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zabura 12.25,26</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Nan Yesu zam nye bar kǝm gono, kan tǝ to den ti, kandatu ar ra na rǝshi gwa'e,<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />&lt;&lt;Kum ni bǝrti da'a, mbarǝm kǝ Urshalima.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Shini, gun gin kǝn den ɗirtǝne, njon den nye bar kǝme.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zakariya 9.9</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Wokoci tu bar ju ba piwo mir mǝn kulci kar ti mom unun munju ba pi nupi da'a. Ama den kaar kǝ ɗǝɗa Yesu na tli gǝs gip mǝshi mbarǝmo, ar ni wu mom den'e bar ju kan pi tiwo untun ar ra na rǝshi terka den ti.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Womti mbarǝmi kan kar ti nan tǝ la bi Li'azaru gip gambǝci kan tǝ tli tika gip mǝshi mbarǝm ci cina na yari mbarǝm argon tu Yesu pi gwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Mbarǝm na womti ɗǝl ni kǝ metǝn na Yesu domici wu kum den halama bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am tu kan tǝ pi gwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Ar ni mǝn Parise wul ezǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ shin capo mii mani pi argon da'a. Shin ni kandatu mbarǝm kup ba kop ti gwa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yari kandatu tǝ ri kǝ mǝshtǝn gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Rawo, mǝn Hellas jen ra gip munju kan te Urshalima kǝ bote Yam wokoci nyel jikat bǝdlabǝni gwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Ar ni wu ri kar Filibus, mbarǝm kǝ Betsaida gip atl kǝ Galili, wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Mǝn nartǝni, mǝ ndu mǝ shin Yesu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filibus ri yari Andǝrawus, kan Andǝrawus na Filibus ba ri yari Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesu bali wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Wokoci ɗir wi kǝ dǝ ɗǝɗa Nya Mbarǝme. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Ge shirǝm ni a yari ine, ge o ni nda atl kan ar mǝsh dawo, ar ba pi ta dǝmi ge o nǝm katl. Ama ar ni mǝsho, ar ba bi mimir na womti. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Murgon tu kup kan gam gǝs ni tǝ ndu'o, tii hol ge mbatl gǝsi. Ama muntu kan nge ge mbatl gǝs den kaar bar atl kǝn baa zam ge mbatl tu kan baa pa da gwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Murgon tu kup ba ndu a dǝm Babom gǝso, tii kopǝn kǝ dǝ las tu ami rawo, dǝ mǝn pim mbapi nǝra lasi. Ban ngap baa ɗǝɗa muntu kup kan ba pim mbap gwa.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />&lt;&lt;Kǝkǝno mbatl gǝn tlika wi kan unun aa wul ra? Bǝba, ba kǝ za dǝ argon tu ba pi gip wokoci kǝn zamǝn da'aya? O'o, kǝ dǝ untu pi namǝn ni a sur ra. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Bǝba, ɗǝɗa sun gi!&gt;&gt; Kan yar gon ba ɗǝl sur yam ba wule, &lt;&lt;A ɗǝɗa'i wi, kan a ri kǝ ɗǝɗa'i ra.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Nan womti mbarǝmi kan ra lasi gwa kum untuwo ar ni wu wule Yam ɓo gam wi, nami ngapo ar ni wu wule nye mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam gon ni shirǝm nan ti.<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Yar tuwo den bi gin ni, ba'e gwan da'a. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Kǝkǝn ni'e wokoci kǝ hukunte atli, kǝkǝn ni ba ri kǝ byali muntu kan den dandi kǝ atl kǝn gwa atli. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Ama amo, wokoci tu tlimka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gip bi kǝ mǝn Hellaso tlimkawo ɗǝɗatǝn ituwi.</char></note> den kaar atlo, aa dǝl mbarǝmka kup karǝmi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Tǝ yari ni muntu kǝ dǝ tǝ gode kandatu tǝ ri kǝ mǝshtǝn gwa.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Womti mbarǝmi shirǝm wu wule, &lt;&lt;Gip kulci gǝmiwo mǝ kum'e Almasihu baa dǝm baa patǝni, ra imnu kǝ wule, &lt;Ar nǝm dǝ tli Nya Mbarǝm yamwe? Wo ni'e Nya Mbarǝm tuwe&gt;?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Ar ni Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Cirtǝn baa nǝra nan kǝn cina njem ɗe. Ɓom ni asǝm kǝkǝn nan kǝn ra na cirtǝni gwa, kapǝn dǝ dǝmǝn tla gam ginka. Mbarǝm tu kan den ɓomi asǝm gip dǝmǝn ba mom las tu kan tǝ ri gwa da'a. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Ngǝsh kǝn ni den cirtǝni nan kǝn ra nan ti gwa, kǝ dǝ kǝ dǝm mimir kǝ cirtǝn ra.&gt;&gt; Nan Yesu pa'i shirǝmo, ar ni tǝ ndara kan tǝ ghuuni wurka.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ci cina na holi ngǝshtǝn den Yam kǝ mǝn Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Kup na halama bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am ju kan Yesu pi den ger gǝzǝni, ama ar ni wu nge ngǝshtǝn den tika. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Muntu pi ni kǝ dǝ ar laa'i shirǝm tu kan mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam Ishaya yari gwa'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">&lt;&lt;Babomi, wo ni nǝm argon tu kan mǝ yari gwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">dǝ wo ni Yam ɓuli ti bar ju kan Babom pi gwawu?&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ishaya 53.1</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Muntu ni kem wu ngǝsh wur den Yam da'a, kandatu Ishaya yari las gon gwa'e,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />&lt;&lt;Yam pali wurka tabiyi wi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">kan tǝ lati mbatl gǝzǝnka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">den ba wu'i mani shini bar na ger gǝzǝni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">ko dǝ mbatl gǝzǝn mani nǝmi bari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">kǝ dǝ wu pal karǝm zam a warke wur ra.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ishaya 6.10</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Ishaya yari ni untu domici tǝ shin ɗǝɗatǝn kǝ Yesu, kan tǝ shirǝm den ti.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Kup na untu jen gip kiri kǝ cina gǝzǝn ngǝsh wur den ti. Ama gip bǝrti kǝ mǝn Parisewo wu mani shirǝm den ngǝshtǝn den Yam gǝzǝn da'a gip bǝrti den ba dǝ ɗǝli wurka gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda da'a. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Rawo, wu paye ndu'i argon tu wii pi dǝ mbarǝm ɗǝɗa wur ra man argon tu wii pi dǝ Yam ɗǝɗa wur gwa.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shirǝm kǝ Yesu baa hukunte mbarǝme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Ar ni Yesu tli yar yam tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm ni ngǝsh ti demǝno, demǝn ni katl tǝ ngǝsh ti da'a, ama na muntu kan karǝm gwa pa'e. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Muntu kup shimǝno, tǝ shin ni muntu kan karǝm gwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />A sur ni atl kǝ dǝ a ɗiri atl kundǝrǝndlip cirtǝni, den ba dǝ ko nǝm gip munju kan ngǝsh wur demǝn dǝm gip dǝmǝn da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Muntu kan kum shirǝm gǝn ama tǝ pi argon tu a yari gwa dawo, aa hukunte ti da'a. Domici a sur ni atl kǝ hukunte mbarǝm da'a, ama kǝ dǝ a ɗǝli mbarǝme. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Mǝn tloyi shirǝm muntu ngem kan ba nǝm shirǝm gǝn da'a ra. Shirǝm tu kan a yari gwa ni baa hukunte ti gas pa'i bar kup. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Bar ju a kulci mbarǝmo karǝm ni ar ɗǝl da'a. Ama Ban kan karǝm gwa ni yarim argon tu aa yari na kandatu aa yari gwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />A mom'e argon tu tǝ wule dǝ pi baa kem dǝ zam ge mbatl tu kan baa pa da gwa. Ra untuwo argon tu kup a yariwo ar ni'e argon tu Bǝba yarim kǝ dǝ a yari gwa.<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ho'i asǝm mir mǝn kulci kar ti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Gip untu kapǝn dǝ pi Nyel Jikat Bǝdlabǝno, Yesu mom den wokoci piwi kan tii za kaar bar atl kǝn tǝ ndara kar Base. Nan tǝ ndu gwas kan ra den kaar atlo, ar ni tǝ gode wur den tǝ ndu wur ar ri patǝn kǝ bari.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Wokoci tu ni Yesu na mir mǝn kulci kar ti den ci fingal kǝ gasi, kan Shetan tare la wi gip mbatl kǝ Yahuda Iskariyoti, nya Siman, kǝ dǝ tǝ bi Yesu ka. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu mom den Bǝbayi la bar kup gip am da ti wi, kan tǝ ɗǝl ni sur kar Yami, kan kar Yam ni tii palo, <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />ar ni tǝ tli gǝs bi fingali, tǝ tus lulur gǝs kǝ den kaarika, kan tǝ ɓal tutul hotǝn ter gǝs da ti. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Ar ni tǝ shoti mal gip bar gali, kan tǝ nǝm ho'i asǝm kǝ mir mǝn kulci kar tiyi, tǝ den sarika na tutul hotǝni nan tǝ ɓal ter gǝs gwa.<verse eid="JHN 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Nan tǝ ɗir den Siman Bitǝruso ar ni Bitǝrus wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Babomi, ki ni kǝ ri kǝ ho'im asǝma?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu bali ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝ mom argon tu kan ami den pi kǝkǝn gwa da'a, ama den kariwo kii momi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Bitǝrus wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;O'o, Babomi, ko njem, kii ho'im asǝm da'a.&gt;&gt; Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ami ni a ho ki dawo, ki gwan ni da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Bitǝrus bali ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, ba'e asǝm gǝn ni katl kii ho da'a ama na am gǝn na gam gǝn ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Muntu kan ho ti kawo, asǝm gǝs ni katl baa ndu ho'i, rawo dli gǝs kupo dlǝran ni ar ra. Dlǝran ni kǝn ra, ama ba'e kup gin ni da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Domici tǝ mom muntu kan ba ri kǝ bi gǝs ka gwa, ar ni kem tǝ wule ba'e kup gin ni ra dlǝran da'a.<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Nan tǝ pa'i ho'i wur asǝmo, ar ni tǝ la tutul dli gǝs kan tǝ pal kǝ ba dǝmi gǝs tǝ ngen momi kar wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝ mani momi argon tu kan a pi in gwaya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Kǝ la'ǝm bi &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci&gt;&gt; na &lt;&lt;Babomi&gt;&gt; kan untu ni ar ra, domici argon tu ami ra gwa itu. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Kǝkǝno ami, Babom na Mǝn kulci ine, ho asǝm ginka, kǝn ma ar ndari kǝ ho'i ni ya'ǝn asǝmka. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />A gode in ni den kǝ pi ni kandatu a pi in gwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Ge shirǝm ni a yari ine, zher ba man babom gǝs da'a, ko dǝ nye mǝn kartǝn man muntu kan kar tiyi gwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Kǝkǝn kan kǝ mom bar juwo, kii dǝm mǝn albarka kǝn ni kǝ pi gwa.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yari den'e baa bali ti kaari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />&lt;&lt;Ba'e a shirǝm ni den kup gin da'a, a mom munju kan a zǝzari gwa. Ama muntuwo kǝ dǝ laa'i argon tu shirǝm kǝ Yam yari gwa ni den'e, &lt;Muntu kan den ci fingal namǝn balim kaarwi.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zabura 41.9</char></note><verse eid="JHN 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />&lt;&lt;A yari in ni kǝkǝn kapǝn ar pi, den wokoci tu ar ni piwo kǝ ngǝsh kǝn ni den ami ni'e ti. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Ge shirǝm ni a yari ine, murgon tu kup kan nǝm muntu a karo, ami ni tǝ nǝmi. Murgon tu kup nǝmǝno tǝ nǝm ni muntu kan karǝm gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Den kaar kǝ yari muntuwo, Yesu dam ti gip ruhu kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ge shirǝm ni a yari ine, nǝm gip kǝn ba ri kǝ balim kaari.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Mir mǝn kulci kar ti shin ezǝn gip damtǝn den murgon tu tǝ shirǝm den ti gwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Nǝm gip mir mǝn kulci kar ti, muntu Yesu ba ndu gwa ra njon kosak na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Siman Bitǝrus pi am nye mǝn kulciyi tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ngen momi kar ti den muntu tǝ shirǝm gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Ar ni nye mǝn kulci kar ti kan dǝm kosak na Yesu gwa ngen momi kar ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, wo ni ba ri kǝ pi ituwe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ti ni'e muntu kan a cen nye bǝredi a si gip gal a ri ti kǝ bi gwa.&gt;&gt; Ar ni nan tǝ si nye bǝrediyi gip galiwo kan tǝ bi Yahuda Iskariyoti, nya Siman. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Na zhotǝne nan Yahuda ci bǝredi tuwo, ar ni Shetan te gip ti. Ar ni Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Yahuda, argon tu kǝ ri kǝ piwo, pi na zhotǝne.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Ama murgon ra gip munju kan Yesu bi wur fingali mom argon tu kem Yesu yari ti untu gwa da'a. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Jen pǝn'e nan Yahuda ni na posh wurpi gǝzǝno, Yesu ba yari ti ni den tǝ ri wur argon tu ba ndu kǝ pi Nyeli, ko den tǝ bi argon munju am ri wur kaar da gwa ni. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Na zhotǝne nan Yahuda ci bǝredi tuwo, ar ni tǝ ɗǝl te kaarika. Ar tu ngap gas ni.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yari den'e Bitǝrus baa nge momi gǝsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Nan Yahuda ndarawo, ar ni Yesu wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝkǝn ni Nya Mbarǝm zam ɗǝɗatǝn kan Yam ba zam ɗǝɗatǝn tǝp kar ti ra gwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Yam ni zam ɗǝɗatǝn tǝp kar tiwo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kor rǝshi tulankuri jen ra na Yam ni zam ɗǝɗatǝn tǝp kar tiwo da'a</char></note> Yam baa ɗǝɗa Nyayi gip gam gǝsi, ar ba dlyam da'a tii zam ɗǝɗatǝni.<verse eid="JHN 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />&lt;&lt;Mimir gǝni, aa dǝm nan kǝn cina ɗe njem. Kii ngenǝmi, ama kandatu a yari mǝn Yahuda gwa'e, &lt;Las tu a riwo, kii mani ritǝn da'a,&gt; untu ni a yari in kǝkǝn pa.<verse eid="JHN 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />&lt;&lt;Pel kulci ni a bi ine. Ndu ni ya'ǝni. Kandatu a ndu kǝn gwa, untun kǝn ma ar nǝm kǝ ndu ni ya'ǝni. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Na untun mbarǝm kup baa mom'e kǝn mir mǝn kulci karǝm ni, kǝn ni kǝ ndu ya'ǝn gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Siman Bitǝrus ngen momi kar ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, ako ni kǝ riwe?&gt;&gt; Yesu bali ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Las tu a riwo, kǝkǝno kii mani kopi gǝn da'a, ama den kariwo kii mani kopi gǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Bitǝrus ngen momi kar ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, ununu kem aa mani kopi gi kǝkǝn da'awu? Aa bi gam gǝn a mǝsh den bi gi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kii bi gam gi kǝ mǝsh den bi gǝna? Ge shirǝm ni a yari'i, kapǝn dǝ tus kor la yar kǝ bǝtloniwo, kii wule kǝ momǝn da'a bisi myakan!<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ni'e tǝp kǝ ritǝn kar Bǝba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />&lt;&lt;Ba kǝ za ni dǝ argon ghun kǝn da'a. Ngǝsh kǝn ni den Yami, kǝ pa ngǝsh kǝn ni demǝni. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Gip bom dǝ Banwo kushi ra na womti. Untu ni fa dawo, na a yari in wi. A ndara ni barta kǝ kǝrkǝmi in lasi. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Ami ni a ndara a kǝrkǝmi in laso, aa pal sur kǝ pǝni gin karǝmi, kǝn ma kǝ dǝm ni las tu ami ra gwa. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Kǝ mom tǝp ritǝn las tu a ri gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Ar ni Toma wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Babomi, mǝ mom las tu kǝ ri gwa da'a, imni mii mom tǝpi rawe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ami ni'e guntǝpe, ge shirǝmi, na ge mbatli. Tǝp karǝm nangǝn ni mbarǝm baa kop wu ri kar Bǝba. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />O Kǝ momǝn fawo, kii mom Ban pa'e. Kǝkǝn na cina ɗewo, kǝ mom ti kǝ pal kǝ shin tiwi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filibus wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Babomi, gode mi Bǝbayi, argon ra kan baa mani mi untu gwa da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Filibus, kup na a dǝm nan kǝn kǝ tlyari wokoci untu ama har kǝkǝn kǝ momǝn diya? Kup murgon tu shimǝno, tǝ shin Bǝba wi. Imni kii wule, &lt;Gode mi Bǝbayi&gt;? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Kǝ ngǝsh ki den'e ami ra gip Bǝbayi, kan Bǝbayi ra gipǝn da'aya? Shirǝm ju a yariwo gwan kǝ gam gǝn ni da'a, ama Bǝbayi kan ba dǝm gipǝn ni'e muntu ba pi mbap gǝs gwa. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Ngǝsh ki demǝn nan a wule ami ra gip Bǝba kan Bǝbayi ra gipǝn gwa. Untu ni dawo ngǝsh kǝn ni den bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am ju kan a pi gwa. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Ge shirǝm ni a yari ine, murgon tu kup kan ngǝsh ti demǝno tii pi argon tu kan ami den pi gwa. Tii pi bar ju kan man munju ma gwa, domici a ndara kar Bǝba wi. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Kano aa pi argon tu kup kǝ liri gip sun gǝn gwa, kǝ dǝ Nyayi ɗiri Bǝbayi ɗǝɗatǝn kar mbarǝme. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Ko unun kǝ liri gip sun gǝno, aa pi ine.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu gudlum shirǝm kǝ bi mbarǝm Ruhu kǝ Yami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />&lt;&lt;Kǝn ni kǝ ndu'ǝmo, kii pi argon tu a wule kǝ pi gwa. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Aa liri Bǝba, ti ngapo tii bi in gon Mǝn Ne Am ra tǝ dǝm nan kǝn baa patǝni. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Ti ni'e Ruhu mǝn ɓuli dǝ mom ge shirǝm den Yami. Mbarǝm kǝ atl baa mani nǝmi gǝs da'a, domici wu bot shini gǝs ko momi gǝs da'a. Ama kǝno kǝ mom ti, domici tǝra den dǝmi nan kǝne, kan tǝ pa dǝm gip mbatl gini. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Aa za kǝn wule mir maraya da'a, ama aa ɗir kar kǝne. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Cina ɗe njemo, mbarǝm kan den kaar bar atl kǝn ba'i shimǝn da'a, ama kǝno kii shimǝni. Domici ami kan ra na ge mbatlo, kǝn ma kii nǝra na ge mbatli. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Gas ta ni kii mom'e ami ra gip Ban, kǝn ngap ra gipǝni, kan ami ra gip kǝne. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Murgon tu kup kan kum kulci gǝn kan tǝ piwo, ti ni'e muntu kan ba ndu'ǝm gwa. Muntu ba ndu'ǝmo Ban baa ndu ti pa'e, kan ami ma aa ndu ti kan a ɓuli ti momi ko ami wo ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Ar ni Yahuda (ba'e Yahuda Iskariyoti da'a) wule, &lt;&lt;Ama Babomi, ununu kem kii gode mi ko ki wo ni ama kii gode nami mbarǝm kan den kaar bar atl dawu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu bali ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Murgon tu kup ba ndu'ǝmo, tii kop argon tu a kulci gwa. Ban baa ndu ti, kan mǝ ɗir kar ti mǝ pi dǝmi gǝmi nan ti. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Muntu kan ba ndu'ǝm dawo, tii kop kulci gǝn da'a. Shirǝm ju kǝ kumo gwan kǝ gam gǝn ni da'a, kǝ Bǝbayi kan karǝm gwa ni.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />&lt;&lt;A yari in ni kup muntu nan a'i ra nan kǝn gwa. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Ama Mǝn Ne Am mbarǝmi, Ruhu kǝ Yami, muntu kan Bǝba baa kar sur gip sun gǝno, tii kulci in bar kup, tǝ pa ne in gip mbatl kup argon tu a yari in gwa. <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Dǝmi zhǝlili ni a za nan kǝne, dǝmi zhǝlili gǝn ni a bi ine. A bi in ni ba'e kandatu mbarǝm kǝ atl ba bi gwa da'a. Ba dǝ argon ghun kǝn ni da'a, eso ba kǝ kum ni bǝrti da'a.<verse eid="JHN 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />&lt;&lt;Kǝ kum a wule, &lt;Aa ndara kan a pa pal ɗir kar kǝne.&gt; Kǝn ni kǝ ndu'ǝmo, kii pi ghol mbatl nan a ndara kar Bǝba gwa, domici Bǝbayi manǝmi. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />A yari in wi kǝkǝni kapǝn ar ɗir pi untuyi, wokoci tu ar ni piwo kǝ ngǝsh kǝn ni den Yami. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Aa'i shirǝm naar nan kǝn da'a, domici muntu kan den dandi atl kǝn den ɗirtǝne. Tǝ ra na argon kan tii mani pim gwa da'a. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Ama tǝ ɗir ni kǝ dǝ mbarǝm kan den kaar bar atl mom'e a ndu Bǝba kan a pi argon tu kan Ban ba ndu a pi gwa. Tli ni yam mǝ za ni ɗe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ni'e ho kin inabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />&lt;&lt;Ami ni'e ho kin inabi, kan Ban ni'e mǝn pi mbap dene. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Ko gonge am kin tu gipǝn kan ba gǝri mimir dawo tii wotlka, kan tǝ kǝrkǝm am kin tu kan ba gǝri gwa, kǝ dǝ ar gǝr ra hoyi. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Kǝkǝn ma ngǝlan ni kǝn ra domici kǝ shirǝm tu kan a yari in gwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Sa ni gipǝni, kandatu ami ma a sa gip kǝn gwa. Am kin gon ra kan baa mani gǝri mimir nan gǝs gwa da'a, se ti ni tǝ sa den nas kin inabiyi. Untu ni kǝn ma kii mani gǝri mimir da'a se kǝn ni kǝ sa gipǝn gwa.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />&lt;&lt;Ami ni'e kin inabiyi, kǝn ni'e ga am kini. Mbarǝm ni sa gipǝn kan ami gip tiwo, tii gǝri mimir na womti, domici bat namǝno kii mani pi argon da'a. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Murgon tu kup kan ba sa gipǝn dawo, ti ni wule am kin tu kan wotl laka kan ba konka gwa, mbarǝm baa dom am kin ju, dǝ wika gip utu, dǝ keri ka. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Kǝn ni kǝ sa gipǝn kan shirǝm gǝn ba sa gip kǝno, argon tu kup kǝ liriwo baa bi ine. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Ban baa zam ɗǝɗatǝni, kǝn ni kǝ pi dǝmi tu kan ba gode'e kǝn mir mǝn kulci karǝm ni, wule kin kan ba gǝri mbuni mimir gwa.<verse eid="JHN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />&lt;&lt;Kandatu Bǝba ba ndu'ǝmo, untu ni a ndu kǝn pa'e. Ra untuwo sa ni gip ndutǝn kan a gode in gwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />A kop bar ju Ban yari gwa, kan a sa gip ndutǝn gǝsi. Untu ni esi, kǝn ni kǝ kop bar ju a yari ino, kii sa gip ndutǝn gǝni. <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />A yari in ni muntu kǝ dǝ ghol mbatl gǝn dǝm gip kǝne, kan kǝn ma dǝ ghol mbatl gin laa'i ra. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Argon tu a wule kǝ pi gwa ni'e kǝ ndu ni ya'ǝni kandatu a ndu kǝn gwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Ndutǝn gon ra kan naar man dǝ mbarǝm bi ge mbatl gǝs den bi kǝ ga berǝm gǝs gwa da'a. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Kǝn ga berǝm gǝn ni kǝn ni kǝ pi argon tu a wul kǝn'e kǝ pi gwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Aa'i la kǝn bi'e mir mǝn pi mbap da'a, domici nye mǝn pi mbap mom argon tu babom gǝs ba pi gwa da'a. Ama a la kin bi'e ga berǝm gǝni, nan a yari in ko unu na unu kan a kulci kar Ban gwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Kǝn ni kǝ zǝzarǝm da'a, ama ami ni a zǝzar kǝn kan a bi in mbap'e kǝ ri gǝri ni mimiri, wule kin kan ba gǝri mimiri, mimir ju kan baa pa dagwa. Ra untu ni Bǝba baa bi in argon tu kup kǝ liri gip sun gǝn gwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Argon tu a wule kǝ pi gwa ni'e kǝ ndu ni ya'ǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbarǝm nge mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />&lt;&lt;Mbarǝm kǝ atl ni nge ino, mom ni'e ami ni wu pare nge. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Kǝn kǝ atl ni faro, atl baa ndu mimir gǝsi. Ama nan kǝn kǝ atl ni da'a, a zǝzar kǝn ni gip mbarǝm kan den atl gwa. Muntu ni kem mbarǝm kǝ atl ba nge ine. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Dami ni shirǝm tu a yari in gwa'e, &lt;Zher ba man babom<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yohana 13.16</char></note> gǝs da'a.&gt; Wi ni wu kumim dliwo, wii kumi in dli pa'e. Na wu kop ni kulci gǝno, wii kop kulci gin pa'e. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Wii pi in ni untu den bi sun gǝni, domici wu mom muntu kan karǝm sur gwa da'a. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Dǝ wule a sur shirǝm ni nan wur dawo, wii nǝra na warwat pitǝn da'a. Ama kǝkǝno, wu ra na argon tu wii yari den pi warwat pitǝn gǝzǝn gwa da'a. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Murgon tu ngemo, tǝ nge ni Ban pa'e. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />A pi mbap gip dlom gǝzǝn kan murgon taɓe pi da gwa. Dǝ wule a pi ni mbap ju far dawo, wii nǝra na warwat pitǝn da'a. Ama kǝkǝno wu shin bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am ju a pi gwa, kup na untu wu nge mi, wu nge Ban pa'e. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Ama ar pini untu kǝ dǝ laa'i argon tu kan ra na rǝshi gip Kulci gǝzǝn gwa'e, &lt;Wu nge mi, ama gǝs kǝ nge gǝni ra da'a.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zabura 35.19; 69.4</char></note><verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />&lt;&lt;Aa kari in bar sur na Mǝn Ne Mbarǝm Am kan ɗǝl sur kar Bǝba gwa. Ti ni'e Ruhu kǝ ge shirǝm kan ɗǝl sur kar Bǝba gwa, ti ni tii bi seda demǝni. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Kǝn ma mǝn bi seda ni demǝni, rawo kǝn ra namǝn na pare pi bari.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />&lt;&lt;A yari in ni bar ju den ba dǝ jili in nika da'a. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Wii ɗǝli inka gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda. Na ho bi, wokoci den ɗirtǝn nan murgon tu kup ri in ekawo, tii pǝn'e mbap kǝ Yam ni tǝ den pi. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Wii pini untu domici wu tare wu mom Bǝba ko ami wi da'a. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />A yari in ni muntu den'e wokociyi ni ɗiro kǝ dami ni'e faro a yari ine.&gt;&gt; A yari in ni bar ju na pare pi bar da'a domici a'i ra nan kǝne.<verse eid="JHN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbap kǝ Ruhu kǝ Yami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />&lt;&lt;Ama kǝkǝno a ndara ni kar muntu kan karǝm sur gwa. Kup na untu gon gin ngen momi da'a tǝ wule, &lt;Ako ni kǝ riwe?&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Kǝ laa'i na dun mbatl wi nan a yari in bar ju gwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Ama ge shirǝm ni a yari in den ar mani in mbuntǝn dǝ a ndara. Ami ni a ndara dawo, Mǝn Ne Mbarǝmi Am baa sur kar kǝn da'a. Ama ami ni a ndarawo, aa kari in bar sur nan ti. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Ti ni tǝ mbirawo, tii kem dǝ mbarǝm kǝ atl kup mom den tǝp gǝzǝn ra kor da'a den pi warwat pitǝne, na den pitǝn dlat, na kandatu Yam baa hukunte mbarǝm gwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Den shirǝm kǝ warwat pitǝno, domici mbarǝm ngǝsh wur demǝn da'a. <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Den shirǝm kǝ pitǝn dlato, domici a ndara kar Ban wi, las tu ki'i shimǝn da gwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Kan den shirǝm kǝ hukuntetǝn ngapo, domici hukunte muntu kan den dandi kǝ atl kǝn gwa wi.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />&lt;&lt;Ami ra na bar na womti kǝ yari ine, ama kii mani pǝni kǝkǝn da'a. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Ama wokoci tu ti Ruhu kǝ ge shirǝmi mbirawo, tii kop nan kǝn gip bar ju kup kǝ ge shirǝm ni gwa. Tii shirǝm kǝ gam gǝs da'a, ama argon tu tǝ kum gwa ni katl tii yari, kan tǝ yari in bar ju kan baa pi gwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Tii ɗirǝm ɗǝɗatǝne, nan argon tu kan a yari in ni tii yari in gwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Bar ju kup kan Bǝba nariwo gwan ni. Ar ni kem a wule Ruhuyi baa pǝn argon tu kan a yari gwa tǝ yari ine.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />&lt;&lt;Gip nye wokoci njemo ki'i shimǝn da'a, kan den kaari njemo kǝ pa shimǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dun mbatl baa pal ghol mbatli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Ar ni jen gip mir mǝn kulci kar tiyi wul ezǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Ununu tǝ pi nupi na wultǝn'e, &lt;Gip nye wokoci njemo ki'i shimǝn da'a, kan den kaar kǝ wokoci njemo kii pa shimǝni&gt; na es &lt;Domici aa ndara kar Bǝba wu?&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Wu ci cina na ngeni momi wu wule, &lt;&lt;Unun tǝ pi nupi na gip nye wokoci njem we? Mǝ mom unun tǝ yari da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesu mom'e mir mǝn kulci kar ti den ndu'i wu ngen momi kar ti den muntu, ar ni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ ngen ni momi kar ya'ǝn den argon tu a pi nupi nan a wule, &lt;Gip nye wokoci njemo ki'i shimǝn da'a, kan den kaar kǝ nye wokoci njemo kii pa shimǝna?&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Ge shirǝm ni a yari ine, kii kul kǝ pi dun mbatli, ama mbarǝm kǝ atlo ghol mbatl ni wii pi. Kii pi dun mbatli, ama dun mbatl gin baa palka ghol mbatli. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Gǝr mǝtli ni den gǝriwo, tǝ kum dli hoyi domici wokoci gǝs piwi, ama ti ni tǝ ɗǝl amo tǝ mǝsǝnika na kumi dli tu tǝ kum gwa domici tǝra laa'i na ghol mbatl nan tǝ ɗiri pel mbarǝm den kaar atl wi gwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Untu ni ar ra nan kǝne, kǝkǝn ni'e wokoci kǝ dun mbatl gi ni, ama aa shin kǝn ra kan kǝ pi ni ghol mbatli. Murgon baa mani kemi dǝ ghol mbatl gin paka da'a. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Gas tawo ki'i liri argon karǝm da'a. Ge shirǝm ni a yari ine, Ban baa bi in argon tu kup kǝ liri gip sun gǝn gwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Har kǝkǝn ma kǝ liri argon gip sun gǝn wi da'a. Liri ni, kii zami, kǝ dǝ ghol mbatl gin laa'i ra.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />&lt;&lt;A shirǝm ni nan kǝn na kolɗa bi. Ama wokoci ra den ɗirtǝn kan aa'i shirǝm nan kǝn na kolɗa bi gwa da'a, ama aa yari in tetla tetla den Ban gwa.<verse eid="JHN 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />&lt;&lt;Gas ta ni ɗiro, kii liri bar gip sun gǝni. A wul ni'e kii liri Bǝba na gam gini, ba'e ami ni aa liri den am gin da'a. <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />Bǝbayi na gam gǝs ba ndu kǝne domici kǝ ndu'ǝmi kan kǝ nǝm wi den a ɗǝl ni sur kar Yami. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />A ɗǝl ni sur kar Bǝbayi kan a sur atli. Kǝkǝno ari kǝ za'i atl kǝn wi, kan a pal gǝn to kar Bǝbayi ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar tiyi wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝkǝno ki den shirǝm kandatu mii mom gwawi, ba'e gip kolɗa bi da'a. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Kǝkǝno mǝ mom wi den'e kǝ mom bar kup. Kǝ mani bali mbarǝm kapǝn tǝ ngen momi kar ki. Muntu kem mǝ ngǝsh mi den kiwi den'e kar Yam ni kǝ ɗǝl suri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule,&lt;&lt;Kǝkǝno kǝ ngǝsh kǝn den Yam wi? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Ama Wokoci den ɗirtǝne, ar mbirawi ma, nan kii gǝzanka, dǝ ko gonge gip kǝn ndara bom gǝs kǝ za'ǝm nan gǝn gwa. Kup na untu ami nangǝn ni da'a, domici Bǝba ra namǝni.<verse eid="JHN 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />&lt;&lt;A yari in ni bar ju den gipǝno kǝ zam ni dǝmi zhǝlili ra. Den kaar bar atl kǝno, kii zam bar ju baa ghun kǝn gwa. Ama dǝm ni na ndǝri mbatli, a tare a tla gam kǝ warwat pitǝn kǝ den kaar atl wi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu shirǝn na Yam den gam gǝsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Den kaar kǝ yari muntuwo, ar ni Yesu tli gam yam kan tǝ shirǝm na Yam tǝ wule,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="JHN 17:1">&lt;&lt;Bǝba, wokoci piwi. Ɗǝɗa Nya gi, kǝ dǝ Nyayi ma tǝ ɗǝɗa ki ra. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Domici ki ni kǝ bi ti iko den mbarǝm kup kǝ dǝ tǝ bi ge mbatl tu kan baa pa da'a kup munju kǝ bi ti gwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Ge mbatl kan baa pa da gwawo ar ni'e dǝ mbarǝm mom ki, ki kan ki ni'e Yam nan gi gwa, kǝ wu pa mom Yesu Almasihu muntu kan kǝ kar gwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />A ɗiri'i ɗǝɗatǝn den kaar atl wi tǝp kǝ ba pa'i pi mbap tu kan kǝ bim a pi gwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Kǝkǝno, Bǝba, ɗǝɗa'ǝm na ɗǝɗatǝn tu ami nari cina da'i kapǝn dǝ pi atl kundǝrǝndlip gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu shirǝm na Yam den am kǝ mir mǝn kulci kar ti</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />&lt;&lt;A gode munju kan kǝ bim gip mbarǝm den kaar atl kǝ wu mom ki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gip bi kǝ mǝn Hellaso </char><char style="fl" closed="false">sun gi</char></note> gwa wi. Terkawo ge ni, ama ki ni kǝ bim wuri, ar tu wu kop shirǝm giwi. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Kǝkǝno wu mom wi den kup argon tu kǝ bimo kar kin ar ɗǝli. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Rawo a bi wur ni shirǝm tu kan kǝ bim gwa kan wu nǝm wi. Wu mom wi den'e na ho bi kar ki ni a ɗǝl suri, kan wu ngǝsh wur den Yam wi den'e ki ni kǝ karǝmi. <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Wi ni a shirǝm nan ki den am gǝzǝni. A shirǝm ni nan ki den am kǝ nami mbarǝm kan den kaar atl gwa da'a, ama den bi kǝ munju kan kǝ bim gwa ni, domici ge ni. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Argon tu kup ami ra nariwo ge ni, kan argon tu kup kan kira nariwo gwan ni. A zam ɗǝɗatǝn wi tǝp kar wuri. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />A'i ri kǝ dǝmi den kaar atl da'a, ama wiwo wu'i ra den kaar atli, kan ami den totǝn kar ki. Bǝba, ki kan dlǝran ni kira gwa, gandǝl wurka na iko kǝ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ko, </char><char style="fl" closed="false">Bǝba, kem wu dǝm mǝn pitǝn dlat gip</char></note> sun gi, sun tu kan kǝ bim gwa ituwi, kǝ dǝ wu dǝm nǝm kandatu mǝn ra nan ki nǝm gwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Nan ami ra nan wuro, a gandǝl wur kan a ne wurka bat na dǝ argon zam wuri tǝp kǝ ba sun tu kǝ bim gwa. Ko nǝm gǝzǝn jilka da'a bat na nǝm tu kan mǝshtǝn ni'e patǝn gǝs gwa kǝ dǝ rǝshi Shirǝm kǝ Yam laa'i ra.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />&lt;&lt;Kǝkǝno kar ki ni a to, ama a yari ni bar ju nan a'i ra den kaar atl gwa, kǝ dǝ wu nǝra laa'i na ghol mbatl gǝn gip mbatl gǝzǝni. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />A yari wur shirǝm giwi kan munju kan kǝ atl ni gwa ba nge wuri, domici wiwo kǝ atl ni wu'i da'a, kandatu ami ma kǝ atl ni da gwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Shirǝm gǝn nan kiwo ba'e kǝ dǝ kǝ pǝn wur ka den kaar atl ni da'a, ama a lir ki ni kǝ dǝ kǝ gandǝl wurka ba dǝ mǝn ɗasi tu tu zam wur da'a. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Wi kǝ atl ni da'a, kandatu ami ma kǝ atl ni da gwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Pali wur dlat tǝp kǝ ba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ko </char><char style="fl" closed="false">kǝ wu dǝm den kandatu</char></note> ge shirǝm gi, argon tu kǝ yari gwa ni'e ge shirǝmi. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Kandatu kǝ karǝm sur gip atlo, untu ni a kar wur rin gip atl ka pa'e. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Domici gǝzǝn ni a ne gam gǝn markǝme den bi gi, kǝ dǝ wu ma dǝ ne wurka markǝm gip ge shirǝm gi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu shirǝm na Yam den am kǝ mǝn kopi kup</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />&lt;&lt;Munju ni katl a shirǝm nan ki den am gǝzǝn da'a. Ama a pa shirǝm ni nan ki den am kǝ munju kan ba ri kǝ ngǝshtǝn den ki tǝp kǝ ba kulci gǝzǝn gwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Bǝba, a liri kǝ dǝ kup gǝzǝn dǝm nǝm. Kandatu ki ra gipǝn kan ami ra gip ki gwa ar ni a liri kǝ dǝ wu ma wu dǝm gip mi den dǝ mbarǝm kup ngǝsh wur den Yam den'e ki ni kǝ karǝmi. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />A tare a bi wur ɗǝɗatǝn tu kan kǝ bim gwa wi, kǝ dǝ wu dǝm nǝm kandatu min ra nǝm nan ki gwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Aa dǝm gip wuri ki ngapo kǝ dǝm gipǝni, kǝ dǝ wu dǝm ra nǝm hoyi, kǝ dǝ mbarǝm kup kan den kaar atl mom'e ki ni kǝ karǝmi, kan'e kǝ ndu wur kandatu kǝ ndu'ǝm gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />&lt;&lt;Bǝba, a ndu'e mbarǝm ju kan kǝ bimo wu nǝra las tu ami ra gwa. A ndu'e wu shin ɗǝɗatǝn gǝni, ɗǝɗatǝn tu kan kǝ bim gwa domici kǝ ndu'ǝm kapǝn ne gǝs kǝ pi atl kundǝrǝndlip.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />&lt;&lt;Bǝba mǝn pitǝn dlat, kup na mbarǝm kǝ den kaar atl mom ki da'a, ama amo a mom ki, kan wu mom'e ki ni kǝ karǝm suri. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />A kem wur wu mom kiwi <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gip bi kǝ mǝn Hellaso </char><char style="fl" closed="false">sun gi</char></note>aa ci cina na kemi gǝzǝn wu mom ki ra, kǝ dǝ ndutǝn tu kan kǝ pimo ar dǝm gip wuri, kan ami ma a dǝm gip wuri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Bi Yesu ka kan ba nǝm ti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Nan Yesu pa'i shirǝm na Yamo, ar ni Yesu na mir mǝn kulci kar ti ndara kan wu jikat dǝndi kǝ Kidǝron. Den kǝti kǝ ɓula'iwo dlyar kǝn zaitun gon ra, ar ni ti na mir mǝn kulci kar ti te gipi.<verse eid="JHN 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yahuda, muntu kan bi tikayi mom lasi, domici Yesu na mir mǝn kulci kar ti ba kur mo barta. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Ar ni Yahuda nde womti mǝn bi utuyi cina, ga mǝn ɓuti bom kǝ Yami, kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yami na mǝn Parise ba te gip dlyari. Wu ɗir na ga toci, pitǝla, dlo na bar kǝ dlanye.<verse eid="JHN 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesu na momi argon tu baa ndo nan tiwo, ar ni tǝ tli ter kar wur tǝ ngen momi tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Wo ni kǝ ngeni?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Wu nǝmi ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Yesu kǝ Nazarat ni.&gt;&gt; Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ami ni.&gt;&gt; (Yahuda mǝn bi gǝsika ra tlor nan wuri.) <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Nan Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ami ni'e ti,&gt;&gt; ar ni wu dǝlka na kaar kan wu nda atlka.<verse eid="JHN 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Ar ni tǝ pa ngen momi kar wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Wo ni kǝ ngeni?&gt;&gt; Kan wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Yesu kǝ Nazarat ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A yari in'e ami ni'e ti. Ami ni fa kǝn den ngeniwo, to za ni mbarǝm ju wu ndara.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Muntu pi ni untu kǝ dǝ shirǝm tu kan Yesu yari gwa laa'i, den'e, &lt;&lt;A hol ko nǝm gip munju kan kǝ bim gwa da'a.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yohana 6.39</char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Ar ni Siman Bitǝrus, muntu kan ra na bar sǝɓǝr gwa, dli bar sǝɓǝr gǝs kan tǝ wotl kǝm kǝ zher kǝ bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa, tǝ pǝni ti kǝm kǝ shimli den gamka. (Sun kǝ zheri ni'e Malkus).<verse eid="JHN 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Yesu wul Bitǝrus'e, &lt;&lt;Pali bar sǝɓǝr gika gip kumti gǝsi! Kǝ kum wule ar nǝm a tla gip gal tu kan Bǝba bim kǝ a tla gwa diya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ri na Yesu bom dǝ Hanana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Ar ni domtǝn kǝ mǝn bi utu kǝ Roma na komanda gǝzǝn na ga mǝn ɓuti bom kǝ Yam ba nǝm Yesu. Wu ɓal tika. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Kan wu pare ri gǝs cina dǝ Hanana, muntu kan bakon kǝ Kayafa, bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam kǝ sheti ghoni ni gwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Kayafa ni'e muntu wokoci gon pi shirǝm kiri kǝ mǝn Yahuda den ar mani mbuntǝn dǝ gon mǝsh den am kǝ mbarǝm kup gwa.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitǝrus nge'e tǝ mom Yesu kǝ nǝm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Siman Bitǝrus na nye mǝn kulci kar Yesu gon den kopi Yesu kaari. Domici nye mǝn kulci kar Yesu tuwo bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa mom ti, ar ni tǝ kop Yesu tǝ te gip dǝbom bom kǝ bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yami gwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Ama Bitǝrus dlǝr te bǝdlabǝn kaarika. Nye mǝn kulci kar Yesu goniyi, muntu kan bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yami mom ti gwa, pal ter na kaari, tǝ shirǝm na nye gǝr tu kan den mbap ɓuti bǝdlabǝn bomi gwa, kan ba ter na Bitǝrus gipi.<verse eid="JHN 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Nye gǝr tu kan den ɓuti bǝdlabǝni ngen momi kar Bitǝrus tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ki ma nǝm gip mir mǝn kulci kar mbarǝm tu ni diya?&gt;&gt; Bitǝrus bali ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ami ra gip wur da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />&lt;&lt;Wokoci iɗatǝn kǝ las ni, ar ni ga zher kǝ bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yami na ga mǝn ɓuti bom kǝ Yam dlǝr kǝ kumi gǝzhin mǝn utu kan wu hor gwa. Bitǝrus ma tǝra dlor nan wuri, tǝ den kumi utuyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam ngen momi kar Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Ar ni bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam ngen momi kar Yesu den mir mǝn kulci kar ti na den kulci gǝsi.<verse eid="JHN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu bali ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A shirǝm na mbarǝm na ghundǝr argonka da'a, a pi ta kulci mbarǝm gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda na gip bom kǝ Yami, las tu mǝn Yahuda kup ba kur dom wur gwa. A yari argon muri da'a. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Unun kem kǝ ngen momi karǝm rawe? Ngen momi kar munju kan kumǝn gwa, ai wu mom argon tu a yari gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Nan Yesu yari muntuwo, ar ni gon gip kǝ cina gǝzǝn kan kosak na Yesu gwa ɓe ti amkayama. Tǝ wul Yesu'e, &lt;&lt;Untu ni kii bali shirǝm bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yama?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu bali ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;O argon ra a yarika mǝgǝniwo, yari. Ama e ge shirǝm ni a yari fawo, unun kem kǝ ɓom we? <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Ar ni Hanana kar bar na Yesu na ɓali dǝ Kayafa, bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitǝrus nge'e tǝ mom Yesu biyi rop na kǝ myakan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Bitǝrus ra dlor den kumi utu, ar ni jen ngen momi wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ki ma nǝm gip mir mǝn kulci kar mbarǝm tu ni diya?&gt;&gt; Ar ni Bitǝrus nge, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ami ra gip wur da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Nǝm gip zher kǝ bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam, mǝn kǝ mbarǝm tu kan Bitǝrus wotli ti kǝmika shirǝm tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A shin ki na Yesu gip dlyar kǝn zaituni diya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Ar ni Bitǝrus pa wule untu ni da'a, gip untuwo ar ni tus kor la yare.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu cina dǝ Bilatus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Kǝ bi cigǝni ar ni kiri kǝ mǝn Yahudayi ɗǝl na Yesu wu za bom kǝ Kayafa wu ndara nan ti bom kǝ gobna kǝ Roma. Ama ar ni wu nge tetǝn gip bomika bǝse wu li gam gǝzǝnka cina dǝ Yam kan ar hane wur ci fingal Jikat Bǝdlabǝni. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Ar ni Bilatus ɗǝl ter kaari tǝ ngen momi kar wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Unu shirǝm ni kǝ ɗiri mbarǝm kǝn cina dene we?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Wu bali ti'e, &lt;&lt;Dǝ wule mbarǝm kǝn pi wani bar gon dawo, o na mǝ ɗir ti cina da'i da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Bilatus wule, &lt;&lt;Pǝn tǝni na gam gin kǝ tloyi tǝni shirǝm den bi kulci gi ni.&gt;&gt; Ar ni mǝn Yahudayi wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Mǝn ra na iko kǝ hukunte mbarǝm dǝ ri ti eka da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Muntu pi ni kǝ dǝ argon tu kan Yesu yari den kandatu tǝ ri kǝ mǝshtǝn gwa laa'i.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Bilatus pal te gip bomka, kan tǝ la bi Yesu tǝ ngen momi kar ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ki ni'e gun kǝ mǝn Yahuda ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu ngen momi kar ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Muntuwo yari kǝ gam gi na ko jen ni yari'i untu demǝni?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Bilatus bali ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ami mǝn Yahuda na? Mbarǝm gin na ga kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam ni ɗir ki cina da'ǝmi. Ununu kǝ piwe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu wule, &lt;&lt;Dǝmi gǝn gunwo kǝ den kaar atl kǝn ni da'a. Na untuno, ga zher gǝn baa dlan wur wu hane kiri kǝ mǝn Yahudayi nǝmi gǝni. Ama dǝmi gun gǝno kǝ ɗe ni da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Bilatus wule, &lt;&lt;Rawo ki gun na?&gt;&gt; Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝ yari dlat na wultǝn'e ami gun ni. Na ho bi, den untu ni gǝri mi, kan den untu ni a sur gip atl, kǝ dǝ a yari shirǝm den ge shirǝmi. Murgon tu kup kan den kopi kaar kǝ ge shirǝmi baa kumǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Bilatus ngen momi tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ununu ni'e ge shirǝmi?&gt;&gt; Ra untuwo ar ni tǝ ɗǝl te kaarika es kar mǝn Yahudayi tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;A zam argon tu kan baa nǝm mbarǝm kǝn dene gwa da'a. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Ama kandatu kǝ kur pi gwa ni kǝ dǝ pǝtli in nye mǝn bom moni nǝm wokoci kǝ Nyel Jikat Bǝdlabǝni. Kǝ ndu a pǝtli in Gun kǝ mǝn Yahuda ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Ar ni wu tli na la'i yar es wu wule, &lt;&lt;O'o, ba'e ti da'a! Bi mi Barabas!&gt;&gt; Barabaso mǝn tli bǝn mbatl ni.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="s">Tloyi Yesu shirǝm den dǝ ɓa tika den kini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Ar ni Bilatus pǝn Yesu kan tǝ kem ba ɓo ti. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Mǝn bi utuyi pi lish kǝ gun ka ire kan wu kemi ti sur gami. Wu kemi ti tlyari lulur mǝn mal galura. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Kan wu pi ta ritǝn kar ti wu den wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Dǝ shirmi ika, gun kǝ mǝn Yahuda!&gt;&gt; Kan wu ɓeɓɓe ti ankiyama.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Bilatus pa ɗǝl ter kaari tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Shin ni, a ɗǝli ti ni ter kar kǝn kǝ dǝ kǝ mom'e a zam ti na argon kǝ hukuntetǝn da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Nan Yesu ɗǝl ter kaari na lish kǝ gun ka ir gam dati na tlyari lulur mǝn mal galurawo, ar ni Bilatus wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝmin kǝni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Nan kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam na ga mǝn ɓuti bom kǝ Yam shin Yesuwo, ar ni wu tli yar yam wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ɓa tika den kini! Ɓa tika den kini!&gt;&gt; Ama Bilatus nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝno pǝn tǝni na gam gin kǝ ɓa tinǝka den kini. Amiwo a zam argon kan tǝ pi kan ndari dǝ hukunte ti gwa da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Ar ni mǝn Yahudayi nǝmi ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝn ra na kulci, kan den kulci gǝmiwo tǝ ndar mǝshtǝni, domici tǝ la bi gam gǝs'e Nya Yami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Nan Bilatus kum untuwo ar ni tǝ kum bǝrti ka ra naari, <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />kan tǝ pal te gip bomka tǝ ngen momi kar Yesu tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ako ni kǝ ɗǝl ɗiru?&gt;&gt; Ama Yesu nǝmi ti da'a. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Bilatus wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ nge shirǝm namǝn kaya, kǝ mom'e ami ra na iko a za ki kǝ ndara ko a ɓa kika den kin da'a ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Rawo, iko tu kan ki ra na ri demǝno muntu kan Yam bi'i gwa ni katl. Warwat pitǝn kǝ muntu kan la'ǝm gip am da'i naar man ge.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Den shirǝm tuwo, ar ni Bilatus ndu tǝ za Yesu tǝ ndara, ama mǝn Yahudayi pi ta la'i yar wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ki ni kǝ za mbarǝm tu tǝ ndarawo, ki berǝm kǝ Kaisar ni da'a. Murgon tu kup kan ba pǝn gam gǝs ti gunno, gapa ni tǝ pi na Kaisar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Nan Bilatus kum muntuwo, ar ni tǝ ɗǝli Yesu ter kaari kan tǝ dǝm den dandi tloyi shirǝm gǝs kan ba la ti bi'e Deɓe kǝ Tate (na bi kǝ Arameik ngapo Gabbata). <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Den pǝt kǝrkǝm bar kǝ nyel Jikat Bǝdlabǝn ni, pǝt to dlom gam wi. Bilatus wul mǝn Yahudayi'e, &lt;&lt;Gun gin tu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Ama mǝn Yahudayi la yar wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ndara nan ti! Ndara nan ti! Ɓa tika den kini!&gt;&gt; Bilatus ngen momi kar wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A ɓa gun ginka den kina?&gt;&gt; Ar ni kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yami nǝmi ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝn ra na gun gon bom na Kaisar da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Ar ni Bilatus bi wur Yesu kǝ wu ɓa tika den kini.<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓa Yesuka den kini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Ar ni mǝn bi utuyi ndara na Yesu. Tǝ pǝn kin kan baa ɓa tika dene gwa tǝ ɗǝl gip bǝni, tǝ ndara las kǝ Kula Gami (na bi kǝ Arameik ar ni'e Golgota). <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Lasi ni wu ɓa tika den kini, kan na jen rop, nǝm den am shimli gon ngapo den am yali kan Yesu te dlom da wurka.<verse eid="JHN 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Bilatus rǝsh argon kan tǝ ɓa to gami da tika. Argon tu rǝsh gwa ni'e, YESU KƏ NAZARAT, GUN KƏ MƏN YAHUDA. <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Mǝn Yahuda na womti zhit argon tu rǝsh gwa, domici las tu ɓa Yesuka den kino kosak na gip bǝn ni ar ra, kan argon tu rǝshiwo, rǝsh ni gip bi kǝ Arameik, Latin na Hellas. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Kan kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam ba wul Bilatus'e, &lt;&lt;Ba kǝ rǝsh'e &lt;Gun kǝ mǝn Yahuda&gt; da'a, ama rǝsh'e &lt;Mbarǝm kǝn wule ti gun kǝ mǝn Yahuda ni.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Bilatus nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Argon tu a rǝsho, a rǝsh wi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Nan mǝn bi utuyi ɓa Yesuka den kino, ar ni wu yem tutul dli gǝs kan wu tatl bomi wupse, ko gonge gǝzǝn na nǝm, kan wu za nye lulur kǝ gipi untu. Nye luluriwo dlǝmi ni dlǝm da'a, zǝluw ni ar ra argon tu nǝm den yari har ba su atl gwa.<verse eid="JHN 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Wu wul ezǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝ tlyati nika da'a. Mǝ la ni guri'a dene mǝ shin ni wo ni baa zami.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.24 Shirǝmi ba zam ni gip Zabura 22.18</char></note> Muntu pini kǝ dǝ laa'i argon tu kan ra na rǝshi gip shirǝm kǝ Yam gwa'e, &lt;&lt;Kan wu tlyati lulur gǝn gip dlom gǝzǝni, kan wu la guri'a den lulur gǝn kǝ gipi.&gt;&gt; Argon tu mǝn bi utuyi pi gwa utu.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Gip munju dlor kosak na kin tu ɓa Yesuka denewo nas ra, na nye mǝn gǝpi kǝ nase, na Maryamu nagǝr kǝ Kǝlopas, kan na Maryamu kǝ Magdala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Nan Yesu shin nas lasi, kan na nye mǝn kulci kar ti kan tǝ ndu gwa dlor kosako, ar ni tǝ wul nas'e, &lt;&lt;Nana, nya gin tu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Kan tǝ wul nye mǝn kulci kar tiyi'e, &lt;&lt;Nana gin tu.&gt;&gt; Argon tu kan pǝn den gas tuwo ar ni nye mǝn kopi gǝsi pǝn nana kǝ Yesu gip bom gǝs tǝ dǝm nan ti.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝshtǝn kǝ Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Den kaar kǝ untuwo, nan Yesu mom'e bar kup piwi, kǝ dǝ argon tu kan ra na rǝshi gip shirǝm kǝ Yam laa'iwo, ar ni tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A kum guzum male.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Zurum gon ra lasi laa'i na mati mal kin inabi. Ar ni wu gi soso gip mati mal kin inabiyi, wu kem sosoyi den dlo kan wu ta'i Yesu toka wu ne ti den bi. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Nan Yesu ɓom mati mal kin inabiyiwo, ar ni tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ar pa wi.&gt;&gt; Na yari untuwo ar ni tǝ la gam atl kan tǝ kotl mbatlka.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Den pǝt Kǝrkǝm bar ni, kan bar ni tlo gwa'e pǝt Shukutǝni. Domici wu mǝn Yahudayi ba ndu wu za dli den kin den pǝt Shukutǝn da'a, kan wu liri Bilatus den dǝ cen asǝm gǝzǝnka, kan dǝ shu dli gǝzǝnka sur den rati kini. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Ar ni ga mǝn bi utuyi ba ɗir kar mbarǝm ju kan ɓa wurka den kin na Yesu gwa, kan wu cen asǝm kǝ mbarǝm kǝ nǝmika na kǝ mǝn nǝmi. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Ama nan wu ɗir den Yesu kan wu zam tǝ tare tǝ mǝshkawo, ar ni wu'i cen asǝm gǝska da'a. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Nan wu pi untuwo, ar ni nǝm gip mǝn bi utuyi tul markǝm ngetl kǝ Yesu na geshe, se car bǝran na mal ba nǝm shottǝni. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Mbarǝm tu kan shin argon tu kan pi gwa ni yari muntu, kan argon tu tǝ yariwo untu ni ar ra. Tǝ mom'e ge shirǝm ni tǝ yari, kan tǝ yari ni kǝ dǝ kǝn ma kǝ ngǝsh kǝn ni den Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Bar ju pi ni untu kǝ dǝ shirǝm kǝ Yam laa'i, muntu kan wule, &lt;&lt;Baa cen ko nǝm gip gul gǝs da'a.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɗǝltǝne 12.46; Dlǝmi Mbarǝme 9.12; Zabura 34.20</char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Shirǝm kǝ Yam pa yari las gon'e, &lt;&lt;Wii shin muntu kan wu tul ti gwa.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zakariya 12.10</char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kapi kǝ Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Den kaariwo, Isubu kǝ Arimatiya ngen den dǝ Bilatus bi ti dli kǝ Yesu. Isubu kǝ Arimatiyayiwo, nye mǝn kopi Yesu ni, ama muri ni tǝ pi domici tǝ bǝrti mǝn Yahuda. Bilatus bi ti bi kǝ pi untu, kan tǝ ɗir pǝn dli kǝ Yesu tǝ ndara nari. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nikodimu, mbarǝm tu kan far ri kar Yesu gip gas gwa ri na Isubu. Nikodimu ɗir na mir mur na alos kan kurtli gwa, bar kǝ kilo hauya nǝm na kutl. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Mbarǝm rop ju ba pǝn dli kǝ Yesu, wu bǝrke ti mir mǝn tǝmi kasǝri, kan wu ghumka na tutul ghumi mǝshi mbarǝme. Muntuwo den kandatu mǝn Yahuda ba kap mǝshi mbarǝm gwa ni. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Las tu kan ɓa Yesu den kino dlyar gon ra lasi, gip dlyari ngapo pel bori gambǝci gon ra, muntu kan kap murgon gipi wi dagwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Domici pǝt Kǝrkǝm bar kǝ mǝn Yahuda ni kan gambǝci'i ra kosak nan wuro, ar ni wu kap dli kǝ Yesuka lasi.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Tlitǝn kǝ Yesu gip mǝshi mbarǝme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Den pǝt Lahadi kǝ cigǝni, tun bar'i pǝlǝu, ar ni Maryamu nye mǝn bǝn kǝ Magdala ri kar gambǝci kǝ Yesu kan tǝ shin kutǝl tat tu kan le bi gambǝci'ika nari gwawi. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Ar ni tǝ ɗir na kǝtǝr kar Siman Bitǝrus na nye mǝn kulci kar Yesu nǝmi, muntu kan Yesu ba ndu gwa, tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Wu pǝn Babomka gip gambǝci'i wi, ngapo mǝ mom las tu wu ne ti gwa da'a!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Ar ni Bitǝrus na nye mǝn kulci kar Yesuyi mǝn nǝmi ri na kǝtǝre kǝ ba gambǝci'i. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Kup gǝzǝn ropi den kǝtǝre, ama nye mǝn kulci kar Yesu nǝmi wuce Bitǝrus, kan tǝ pare mbu'i bar gambǝci'i. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Tǝ ngus tǝ la ger su gipika kan tǝ shin tutul ghumi mǝshi mbarǝmi lasi markǝme, ama tǝ su gipi da'a. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Den kaariwo kan Bitǝrus ba mbubari, tǝ su gip gambǝci'i. Tǝ shin tutul ghumi mǝshi mbarǝmi lasi markǝme. <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />Tǝ pa shin tutul tu kan ɓali Yesu ɗir gam gwa na kucimi las nǝm, markǝmi na ghol mayaniyi. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Den kaariwo ar ni nye mǝn kulci kar Yesu mǝn nǝmi, muntu kan pare mbu'i bar bi gambǝci'i gwa, tǝ ma tǝ su gipi. Tǝ shin kan tǝ ngǝsh ti den Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />(Ama kup na untu wu mani momi argon tu shirǝm kǝ Yam yari den ar nǝm dǝ Yesu tli gip mǝshi mbarǝm da'a.) <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar Yesuyi pal gǝzǝn rǝn bomka.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɗǝl kar Maryamu kǝ Magdala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Ama Maryamu dlǝr bi gambǝci'i tǝ den kulu. Ti gip kuluwo ar ni tǝ ngus kan tǝ la ger su gip gambǝci'ika <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />ar ni tǝ shin mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam rop na ghol tutul dli, njon las tu far dli kǝ Yesu ra gwa, nǝm kǝ ba gami kan nǝm tǝp kar asǝme.<verse eid="JHN 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Ar ni mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami ngen momi kar ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Nagǝre, unun kem ki den kulu we?&gt;&gt; Ar ni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Wu pǝn Babom gǝn kawi, kan a mom las tu wu ne ti gwa da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Tǝ pa'i yari muntuwo ar ni tǝ bal ti, se tǝ shin Yesu dlor, ama tǝ mani momi'e Yesu ni da'a.<verse eid="JHN 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Ar ni Yesu ngen momi tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Nagǝre, unun kem kǝ den kulu we? Wo ni kǝ den ngeni we?&gt;&gt; Maryamu pǝn'e ti ni'e mǝn kǝni, ar ni tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Bar mbarǝme, ki ni fa kǝ pǝn tikawo, yarim las tu kǝ ne ti gwa, aa ri pǝn ti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu la ti bi tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Maryamu!&gt;&gt; Ar ni tǝ bal ti rǝn den tika kan tǝ shirǝm gip bi kǝ mǝn Yahuda tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Rabboni!&gt;&gt; (Ba mǝn kulci ituwi).<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ba kǝ nǝm dli gǝn da'a, domici a pal to kar Banka wu da'a. Ama ri yari mir ɓyar'e, a ri kǝ paltǝn kar Ban kan Be gini, kar Yam gǝni kan Yam gini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Ar ni Maryamu nye mǝn bǝn kǝ Magdalayi ri kar mir mǝn kulci kar Yesuyi na zo shirǝm kǝn'e, &lt;&lt;A shin Babom wi!&gt;&gt; Kan tǝ yari wur argon tu Yesu yari gwa.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɗǝl kar mir mǝn kulci kar ti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Gas Lahadi kǝ sit nan mir mǝn kulci kar Yesu ra kǝba lasi nǝm, na bǝdlabǝn kushi gǝzǝn kup na le den bǝrti kǝ mǝn Yahudawo, ar ni Yesu ɗir kan tǝ dlǝr gip dlom gǝzǝn tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Dǝ dǝmi zhǝlili kop kǝne!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Den kaar kǝ yari muntuwo ar ni tǝ gode wur am gǝs na markǝm tu gǝsi. Mir mǝn kopi gǝsi pi ghol mbatl naar na shini Babomi.<verse eid="JHN 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu pa wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Nǝm ni dǝmi zhǝlili! Kandatu Bǝba karǝm gwa untu ni a kar kǝn pa'e.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Nan tǝ yari untuwo ar ni tǝ hori wur kuskǝnu gǝsi kan tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Nǝm ni Ruhu kǝ Yami. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Murgon tu kup kǝ gaparte ti warwat pitǝn gǝs kawo, gaparte ti ituwi, kan murgon tu kup kǝ gaparte tika dawo, gaparte ti da'a ituwi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɗǝl kar Toma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Rawo, Toma, nǝm gip mir mǝn kulci kutl cet ropi (kan ba la ti bi'e Nye Ngumci<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Toma (na bi kǝ Arameik) na Didimus (na bi kǝ mǝn Hellas) kup rop ju ba pi nupi'e ngumci</char></note>) ra gip wur da'a nan Yesu ri kar wur gwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Ar ni nami mir mǝn kulciyi yari ti'e, &lt;&lt;Mǝ shin Babom wi.&gt;&gt; Ama tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ami ni a shin shu kusa ju den am gǝsi, a kem yasa gǝn gip shu kusayi, kan a ne am gǝn den markǝm tu gǝs dawo, aa nǝm da'a!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Muri wusupse den kaar kǝ muntuwo, mir mǝn kulci kar Yesuyi ra gip bom esi, kan Toma ra nan wuri. Kup na bǝdlabǝn kushiyi kup ra na le, ama Yesu ɗir kan tǝ dlǝr gip dlom gǝzǝn tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Nǝm ni dǝmi zhǝlili!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Ar ni tǝ wul Toma'e, &lt;&lt;Kem yasa gi ɗe, shin am gǝni. Ta am gi kǝ kem gip markǝm tu gǝni. Za damtǝn kǝ ngǝsh ki demǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Toma nǝmi Yesu tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Babom gǝni, na Yam gǝni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Kan Yesu ba wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Nan kǝ shimǝno, kǝ ngǝsh ki demǝn wi. Mǝn albarka ni'e munju kan shimǝn da'a ama kup na untu wu ngǝsh wur demǝn gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Argon tu kem rǝsh tǝlankur kǝn gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesu pi halama bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am jen na womti den ger kǝ mir mǝn kulci kar ti, munju kan rǝsh gip tǝlankur kǝn da gwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Ama rǝsh ni mǝnjǝn kǝ dǝ kǝ ngǝsh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ko </char><char style="fl" closed="false">kǝ dǝ kǝ ci cina na ngǝshtǝn </char></note> kǝn ni den Yesu ni'e Almasihu, Nya Yami. Kan tǝp kǝ ba ngǝshtǝn den tiwo kǝ zam ni ge mbatl gip sun gǝsi.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu pi bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn nǝmi kose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Den kaar kǝ untuwo, ar ni Yesu pa ɗǝl kar mir mǝn kulci kar ti bi bar ɓula kǝ Tiberiya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓula kǝ Galili, nǝm ar ni'e ɓula kǝ Tiberiya na bi kǝ mǝn Hellas</char></note> Kandatu ar pi gwa ikǝni. <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Siman Bitǝrus, Toma (kan ba la ti bi'e Nye ngumci<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Didimus (na bi kǝ mǝn Hellas) kup rop ju ba pi nupi'e ngumci </char></note> gwa), Natanayilu mbarǝm kǝ Kana gip atl kǝ Galili, mimir kǝ Zabadi, na mir mǝn kulci kar Yesu jen rop ra lasi nan wuri. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Siman Bitǝrus wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;A ri kǝ nǝmi kose.&gt;&gt; Ar ni nami mir mǝn kulci kar Yesuyi wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝn ma mii ri nan ki.&gt;&gt; Ar ni wu ndara kan wu to gip kungǝlǝn jikat male, ama gip gastawo wu nǝm argon da'a.<verse eid="JHN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Kǝ bi cigǝniwo ar ni Yesu dlǝr den bishidi bar ɓula'i, ama mir mǝn kulci kar tiyi mani momi'e Yesu ni da'a.<verse eid="JHN 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Ar ni tǝ la wur bi tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mir moni, kǝn ra na kosa?&gt;&gt; Kan wu nǝmi ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;O'o.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;La ni bar kǝ nǝmi kos gin den am shimli kǝ kungǝlǝn jikat mali, kii nǝm jeni.&gt;&gt; Nan wu piwo, kan wu nǝm kos na womti har wu'i mbu dǝli bar kǝ nǝmi kosi tor gip kungǝlǝn jikat mali da'a.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Ar ni nye mǝn kulci tu Yesu ba ndu gwa wul Bitǝrus'e, &lt;&lt;Babom ni ca!&gt;&gt; Nan Siman Bitǝrus kum'e Babomno ar ni tǝ pǝn tutul dli gǝs tǝ la'i, (domici tǝ tuska wi den bi mbapi) kan tǝ nda su gip malika. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Nami mir mǝn kulci kar ti gip kungǝlǝnyi ɗiri, kan wu dǝl bar kǝ nǝmi kosi tor laa'i na kose. Rawo, wu dlyam na gam bishidi bar ɓula'i da'a, bar kǝ desi asǝm hauya kutl cet nantam (300) ni.<verse eid="JHN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Nan wu ɗǝl tor gip maliwo, ar ni wu shin gǝzhin mǝn utu gon lasi, na kos dene, kan na bǝredi jeni. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ɗiri ni jen gip kos ju kan kǝ'i nǝm gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Ar ni Siman Bitǝrus to gip kungǝlǝn jikat mali kan tǝ dǝl bar kǝ nǝmi kosi tor den bishidi. Laa'i na kiri kos gudǝli hauya nyingi na kutl cet myakan (153), ama kup na womtitǝn gǝzǝn juwo bar kǝ nǝmi kosi tlyatka da'a. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ɗir karye ni.&gt;&gt; Gon ra da'a gip mir mǝn kulci kar Yesuyi kan kǝrce kǝ wuli gǝs'e, &lt;&lt;Ki wo ni we?&gt;&gt; Nan wu mom'e Babom ni gwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Ar ni Yesu ɗir kan tǝ pǝn bǝredi tǝ bi wuri, kan tǝ pa pǝn kosi tǝ bi wuri. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Muntu ni'e ɗǝltǝn kǝ Yesu kǝ myakan kar mir mǝn kulci kar ti den kaar kǝ tlitǝn gǝs gip mǝshi mbarǝme.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu shirǝm na Bitǝrus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Nan wu pa'i ci baro, ar ni Yesu wul Siman Bitǝrus'e, &lt;&lt;Siman nya Yohana, na ho bi kǝ ndu'ǝm man munju ya?&gt;&gt; Siman nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Aan, Babomi, kǝ mom'e a ndu ki.&gt;&gt; Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Bi tǝm gǝn fingali.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Yesu pa ngen momi kar ti kǝ ropi tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Siman nya Yohana, na ho bi kǝ ndu'ǝma?&gt;&gt; Siman nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Aan, Babomi, kǝ mom'e a ndu ki.&gt;&gt; Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ne ger den tǝm gǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Yesu pa ngen momi kar ti kǝ bisi myakani, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Siman nya Yohana, kǝ ndu'ǝma?&gt;&gt; Ar ni ar ghun Bitǝrus domici bisi myakan ituwi tǝ ngen momi kar ti na wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ ndu'ǝma?&gt;&gt; Ar ni tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Babomi, kǝ mom ko unu, kǝ mom'e a ndu ki.&gt;&gt; Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Bi tǝm gǝn fingali. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Ge shirǝm ni a yari'i, nan kǝ'i ɗaliwo kǝ kem tutul dli gi kǝ ndara las tu kǝ ndu gwa, ama wokoci tu kǝ korsiwo kii ta am gi, kan dǝ murgon kemi'i tutul dli kan tǝ ri'i las tu kan kǝ ndu ritǝn da gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Yesu yari ni untu kǝ dǝ tǝ gode wur kandatu Bitǝrus ba ri kǝ mǝshtǝn kan baa ɗǝɗa Yam gwa. Ar ni Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kopǝni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Nan Bitǝrus bal tiwo, ar ni tǝ shin nye mǝn kulci tu kan Yesu ba ndu ti gwa ra den kopi gǝzǝni. (Ti ni'e muntu kan dǝm kosak na Yesu wokoci ci fingal kǝ Nyel Jikat Bǝdlabǝn gwa. Ti ni'e muntu kan ngen momi kar Yesu gwa tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, wo ni ba ri kǝ bi gi kayi?&gt;&gt;) <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Nan Bitǝrus shin tiwo, ar ni tǝ ngen momi kar Yesu tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, im nu baa ndo na mbarǝm tuwe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ami ni a ndu tǝ dǝm ra ar ri paltǝn gǝn suro, unun ghun kiwe? Ki de kopǝni!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Yari untu kem shirǝm tu nga las gip mir mǝn kopi den'e nye mǝn kulci kar Yesu tu baa mǝsh da'a. Ama rawo ba'e Yesu wul ni'e tii mǝsh da'i da'a, ama tǝ wul ni'e, &lt;&lt;Ami ni a ndu tǝ dǝm ra ar ri paltǝn gǝn suro, unun ghun kiwe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Ti ni'e nye mǝn kulci kar Yesu tu kan bi seda den bar ju, kan tǝ pa rǝsh gwa. Mǝ mom'e seda gǝs den Yesuwo untun ar ra.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Bar ra na womti kan Yesu pi gwa. Dǝ wule baa rǝsh ni kupo, a shin atl kundǝrǝndlip baa zam ba ne tǝlankur ju kan baa rǝsh gwa da'a.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>